1
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:36,828
Hello?

2
00:00:36,911 --> 00:00:38,663
[babae sa telepono] <i>Hello, Modesta.</i>

3
00:00:40,123 --> 00:00:41,124
Sino 'to?

4
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:44,878
[direktor] <i>Sige, gagawan ko</i>
<i>ng paraan 'yan, Madam.</i>

5
00:00:45,462 --> 00:00:47,547
Dencio, trabaho na ulit!

6
00:00:48,131 --> 00:00:49,841
Cake, nasaan si Jo?

7
00:00:49,924 --> 00:00:51,134
{\an8}Nandito, Direk!

8
00:00:51,217 --> 00:00:53,470
{\an8}Gusto ng network na ibalik si Dencio, Jo.

9
00:00:53,553 --> 00:00:56,222
{\an8}Di ba patay na si Dencio? Binaril?

10
00:00:56,306 --> 00:00:59,601
{\an8}Gusto n'yo bang ma-cancel itong serye?
Hindi, di ba?

11
00:00:59,684 --> 00:01:00,518
{\an8}Oo.

12
00:01:01,227 --> 00:01:03,354
{\an8}O, sige, paano natin bubuhayin ang patay?

13
00:01:03,438 --> 00:01:06,107
{\an8}Paano kung multo siya?
Bangungot? Reincarnation?

14
00:01:06,191 --> 00:01:07,859
{\an8}Action serye ito, hindi fantasy.

15
00:01:07,942 --> 00:01:10,028
{\an8}Jo, ikaw ang writer, di ba?
Isipin mo.

16
00:01:10,111 --> 00:01:12,113
{\an8}E kasi naman binibigla ninyo ako.

17
00:01:12,197 --> 00:01:13,531
{\an8}Spirit, ganyan? Ano?

18
00:01:13,615 --> 00:01:15,700
{\an8}-Spirits talaga?
-Thank you.

19
00:01:15,784 --> 00:01:17,952
{\an8}Isa pa, Direk, paano kung kambal?

20
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,289
{\an8}Kambal.

21
00:01:21,372 --> 00:01:23,750
{\an8}Case closed! May kambal si Dencio.

22
00:01:25,668 --> 00:01:27,629
{\an8}[babae] Lintik, Matty!

23
00:01:27,712 --> 00:01:31,299
{\an8}Papatayin kita kung di mo naimpake
'yong bag! Seryoso ako!

24
00:01:31,382 --> 00:01:32,759
{\an8}Pinaalala mo ng 500 beses.

25
00:01:32,842 --> 00:01:34,636
{\an8}-Talaga?
-Oo, 500 beses!

26
00:01:34,719 --> 00:01:38,056
{\an8}Limandaan! Ah, binilang mo talaga!

27
00:01:38,139 --> 00:01:40,433
{\an8}Hay nako, napaka-pilosopo pa!

28
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:42,393
{\an8}Tarantado. Buwisit ka!

29
00:01:43,770 --> 00:01:46,189
{\an8}Hoy! Ikaw ba 'yong driver namin?

30
00:01:46,272 --> 00:01:47,607
{\an8}Ma'am Paz Delos Santos?

31
00:01:47,690 --> 00:01:49,943
{\an8}Wag mo akong tawaging ma'am. Bata pa ko!

32
00:01:50,026 --> 00:01:50,902
{\an8}Ako na, ma'am.

33
00:01:50,985 --> 00:01:52,612
{\an8}-Pumasok ka sa kotse.
-Ako na po.

34
00:01:52,695 --> 00:01:53,655
{\an8}Sabing wag ma'am.

35
00:01:56,908 --> 00:01:58,535
{\an8}[bumubulong nang di maintindihan]

36
00:01:58,618 --> 00:01:59,619
{\an8}Shit, totoo ba 'to?

37
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:02,455
{\an8}Oo. Susunduin ng papa mo sa pier.

38
00:02:03,164 --> 00:02:06,126
{\an8}'Nay, kailangan na ako sa trabaho,
tawagan ko na lang kayo.

39
00:02:06,668 --> 00:02:08,044
{\an8}Jo? Hello, 'nak?

40
00:02:10,296 --> 00:02:12,006
{\an8}Nabuhay ang bangkay.

41
00:02:12,090 --> 00:02:12,924
{\an8}Sino?

42
00:02:13,007 --> 00:02:15,927
{\an8}'Yong babaeng nag AWOL, nandito.

43
00:02:16,594 --> 00:02:17,637
{\an8}Totoong nanay mo?

44
00:02:18,930 --> 00:02:20,765
{\an8}Our Lady of Eternal Absence?

45
00:02:21,391 --> 00:02:23,685
{\an8}OMG!

46
00:02:23,768 --> 00:02:27,147
{\an8}Nagbabalik ang dating starlet!

47
00:02:27,230 --> 00:02:29,315
{\an8}[lalaki sa radyo]
<i>Magandang umaga po sa lahat.</i>

48
00:02:29,399 --> 00:02:32,777
{\an8}<i>Isa na naman pong masamang balita</i>
<i>ang ating nakalap ngayon…</i>

49
00:02:33,862 --> 00:02:35,321
{\an8}Di 'to kapani-paniwala.

50
00:02:38,533 --> 00:02:40,535
{\an8}Welcome home!

51
00:02:40,618 --> 00:02:42,245
{\an8}Ang weird mo, Ma!

52
00:02:43,037 --> 00:02:45,039
{\an8}Isa pa 'yang workshop na 'yan e.

53
00:02:45,123 --> 00:02:47,208
{\an8}Alam mo ang dami-daming kailangan.

54
00:02:47,292 --> 00:02:49,919
{\an8}Kailangan ngayon pa lang
may sequence treatment na.

55
00:02:50,003 --> 00:02:51,921
{\an8}Buti nga naayos ko na 'yong visa ko e.

56
00:02:52,005 --> 00:02:54,591
{\an8}Sus, kayang-kaya mo 'yan, girl!

57
00:02:54,674 --> 00:02:57,051
{\an8}Ito nga binuhay mo ang patay, o! Di ba?

58
00:02:57,135 --> 00:03:01,472
{\an8}Eighteen sequences, on the spot! Ikaw na!

59
00:03:01,556 --> 00:03:03,474
{\an8}Girl, iba ang Amerika.

60
00:03:03,558 --> 00:03:06,352
{\an8}Malay mo pagdating mo do'n sa Amerika,
kunin ka nila

61
00:03:06,436 --> 00:03:08,271
{\an8}Miss Shonda Rhimes!

62
00:03:08,354 --> 00:03:11,190
{\an8}Wow, society, girl, society!

63
00:03:12,191 --> 00:03:13,151
Teka!

64
00:03:13,234 --> 00:03:15,236
Iiwanan mo ang lahat ng ito, ha?

65
00:03:16,905 --> 00:03:18,573
-Ito?
-Yeah!

66
00:03:20,033 --> 00:03:22,368
-Yeah?
-Yeah!

67
00:03:22,452 --> 00:03:23,536
Oo naman, 'no!

68
00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:25,914
[busina ng barko]

69
00:03:27,916 --> 00:03:30,835
Gising, Matias, gising!

70
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:31,753
Ano?

71
00:03:33,338 --> 00:03:40,220
Kailangan mong langhapin 'yon, ha?
Langhapin mo. Purong hanging dagat.

72
00:03:40,303 --> 00:03:41,804
Purong hanging dagat.

73
00:03:41,888 --> 00:03:43,848
Oo, ang dagat.

74
00:03:43,932 --> 00:03:45,141
-Heto.
-Salamat.

75
00:03:46,684 --> 00:03:48,895
Ang weird lang makabalik, alam mo 'yon?

76
00:03:48,978 --> 00:03:51,397
Siguradong excited silang makita tayo.

77
00:03:52,482 --> 00:03:53,316
Talaga.

78
00:03:54,067 --> 00:03:55,526
Alam mo bang sikat ako dati?

79
00:03:55,610 --> 00:03:56,611
Mm-mmh

80
00:03:56,694 --> 00:03:58,029
Oo nga!

81
00:04:00,198 --> 00:04:05,453
Dati akong up and coming
dramatic star ng Maynila!

82
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:09,499
Nakarating ka ba?

83
00:04:11,709 --> 00:04:13,628
Ihuhulog kita diyan, sige ka!

84
00:04:15,421 --> 00:04:16,714
Nandito na tayo.

85
00:04:38,653 --> 00:04:40,863
Matty, bantayan mo ang mga bag!

86
00:04:40,947 --> 00:04:42,907
Di naman tatakbo ang mga 'yan!

87
00:04:42,991 --> 00:04:44,075
Diyos ko!

88
00:04:50,331 --> 00:04:51,165
Rene!

89
00:04:54,752 --> 00:04:55,712
Rene!

90
00:04:56,254 --> 00:04:57,213
Ikaw na ba 'yan?

91
00:04:57,755 --> 00:04:58,881
Pambihira!

92
00:04:58,965 --> 00:05:01,009
-Ilagay n'yo sa likod.
-Sino 'yan?

93
00:05:01,092 --> 00:05:03,720
-Ito pa rin ang kotse mo?
-Oo, ikaw naman e.

94
00:05:03,803 --> 00:05:06,681
Alam mo namang di ako basta-basta
nagtatapon ng di sira.

95
00:05:06,764 --> 00:05:07,682
Sino 'yan?

96
00:05:08,725 --> 00:05:09,559
Anak ko.

97
00:05:09,642 --> 00:05:12,061
Ahh. O, welcome.

98
00:05:12,145 --> 00:05:13,688
Feel at home!

99
00:05:13,771 --> 00:05:14,939
Bilisan n'yo!

100
00:05:15,773 --> 00:05:17,233
Salamat po!

101
00:05:17,317 --> 00:05:18,943
Dahan-dahan, Matty!

102
00:05:19,027 --> 00:05:19,944
[umiigik]

103
00:05:21,237 --> 00:05:22,322
Kumpleto na?

104
00:05:23,614 --> 00:05:24,907
Ayos na!

105
00:05:24,991 --> 00:05:26,993
-[Paz] Ayos ka lang, Matty?
-[Matty] Oo.

106
00:05:27,076 --> 00:05:29,203
-Nasa taas ba 'yong kahon?
-Oo.

107
00:05:49,891 --> 00:05:51,225
Ayan.

108
00:05:51,309 --> 00:05:53,519
Na-miss ka nitong bahay na 'to.

109
00:06:00,860 --> 00:06:03,321
Nagpalinis ako ng bahay kina Claro.

110
00:06:03,404 --> 00:06:05,281
Naalala mo 'yong boy natin noon?

111
00:06:05,364 --> 00:06:07,241
Matanda na 'yon.

112
00:06:22,215 --> 00:06:25,843
[Modesta] 'Yong dati mong kuwarto,
si Jo ang gumagamit pag andito siya.

113
00:06:25,927 --> 00:06:27,720
Madalang din umuwi ang batang 'yon.

114
00:06:28,721 --> 00:06:30,848
Hinanda rin namin
'yong kuwarto ng papa mo.

115
00:06:31,891 --> 00:06:34,727
Ay, nasaan 'yong kasama mo?

116
00:06:39,732 --> 00:06:41,692
Ang bunso ko nga pala, si Matty.

117
00:06:42,401 --> 00:06:44,862
[Modesta] Wow, ka-pogi!

118
00:06:45,571 --> 00:06:47,115
Artistahin!

119
00:06:47,824 --> 00:06:49,200
[Paz] Magmano ka kay Manang.

120
00:06:49,283 --> 00:06:51,619
Manang-mana sa mama niya!

121
00:06:52,787 --> 00:06:55,414
Diyos ko, i-kiss mo siya!

122
00:06:59,627 --> 00:07:02,380
Halika, pasok sa loob.
Marunong bang mag-Tagalog 'to?

123
00:07:08,219 --> 00:07:11,681
[banayad na ugong ng dagat]

124
00:07:11,764 --> 00:07:13,474
[tugtog ng gitara]

125
00:07:13,558 --> 00:07:16,144
[Paz] <i>Matias! Tumigil ka na!</i>

126
00:07:17,812 --> 00:07:18,813
[pagtigil ng gitara]

127
00:07:23,734 --> 00:07:26,696
[tumutunog na cellphone]

128
00:07:34,203 --> 00:07:35,413
Pa.

129
00:07:35,496 --> 00:07:40,084
[Rene] <i>Jo, anak, umuwi ka naman.</i>
<i>Gusto ka nang makita ng Mama mo.</i>

130
00:07:42,086 --> 00:07:43,796
Ano'ng… Mmm…

131
00:07:44,672 --> 00:07:46,841
Pa, ang dami talagang trabaho kasi, e.

132
00:07:46,924 --> 00:07:49,469
<i>Anak, pamilya naman muna.</i>

133
00:07:49,552 --> 00:07:52,472
<i>Di naman puwedeng</i>
<i>puro trabaho lang inaatupag mo.</i>

134
00:07:53,306 --> 00:07:55,683
<i>Ang tagal na rin</i>
<i>na hindi ka nagpupunta dito.</i>

135
00:07:56,559 --> 00:07:58,102
<i>Punta ka na.</i>

136
00:07:58,186 --> 00:07:59,770
<i>Matagal-tagal ka na ring hindi…</i>

137
00:07:59,854 --> 00:08:00,980
Ow!

138
00:08:01,063 --> 00:08:03,483
<i>Ano'ng nangyari? Anak, okay ka lang?</i>

139
00:08:04,066 --> 00:08:05,359
Pa, balikan ko kayo.

140
00:08:06,068 --> 00:08:07,028
<i>Okay ka—</i>

141
00:08:08,029 --> 00:08:09,280
[napasinghap sa sakit]

142
00:08:18,122 --> 00:08:20,541
Sunod-sunod na lang!

143
00:08:21,292 --> 00:08:26,130
Okay, sige, ikuwento mo.
Isa-isahin natin yan.

144
00:08:26,214 --> 00:08:28,090
Basta tandaan mo, safe space 'to.

145
00:08:28,174 --> 00:08:31,135
Itong workshop na ito,
hindi ako nagrereklamo…

146
00:08:32,178 --> 00:08:39,060
Kasi pagkakataon ko nang…
mapaganda ang buhay ko.

147
00:08:39,894 --> 00:08:44,148
Kaya lang, parang, alam mo 'yon,
habang lumalapit siya, nagdududa ako kung…

148
00:08:45,316 --> 00:08:47,443
Kung ito ba ang tamang gawin.

149
00:08:47,527 --> 00:08:52,865
Dahil pakiramdam ko…
di ko alam, parang may kulang.

150
00:08:54,242 --> 00:08:58,371
Alam ko na magandang pagkakataon 'to
at puwedeng mabago ang buhay ko, pero…

151
00:08:59,372 --> 00:09:04,669
pakiramdam ko may dapat muna akong gawin.

152
00:09:04,752 --> 00:09:07,797
ang trip ba ang pinag-uusapan natin o…

153
00:09:07,880 --> 00:09:09,715
may iba bang bumabagabag sa 'yo?

154
00:09:19,475 --> 00:09:21,352
Andito si Paz.

155
00:09:25,022 --> 00:09:26,107
[napabuntung-hininga]

156
00:09:33,948 --> 00:09:35,825
Bumalik na siya.

157
00:09:37,410 --> 00:09:41,080
Kung kailan nakakamove-on na 'ko sa buhay.

158
00:09:41,622 --> 00:09:44,166
Kailangan ko na namang buksan
ang mga dating sugat?

159
00:09:45,334 --> 00:09:47,837
{\an8}Tapos itong si Papa, pinapapunta ako.

160
00:09:48,546 --> 00:09:52,049
Na para bang ayos lang,
gano'n lang, wala lang.

161
00:09:52,133 --> 00:09:55,595
Ni hindi ko siya kilala.

162
00:09:56,971 --> 00:09:58,889
Wala siyang pakialam sa akin.

163
00:10:00,349 --> 00:10:02,143
'Yon 'yong hindi nila maintindihan.

164
00:10:02,226 --> 00:10:06,397
Na pinaghirapan ko
na makarating sa puntong 'to.

165
00:10:07,898 --> 00:10:10,276
Sure, pamilya, di ba?

166
00:10:10,359 --> 00:10:13,946
Pero, puta naman, paano naman ang gagawin
mo kung ganyan ang pamilya mo?

167
00:10:15,573 --> 00:10:16,490
Di ba?

168
00:10:19,493 --> 00:10:20,661
E di wag kang pumunta.

169
00:10:22,204 --> 00:10:23,205
Wag kang pumunta.

170
00:10:24,749 --> 00:10:26,834
May sarili ka nang buhay.

171
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:30,880
Choice mo 'yon.

172
00:10:32,548 --> 00:10:34,425
Naaalala mo 'yong pinag-usapan natin…

173
00:10:35,384 --> 00:10:36,719
Personal boundaries.

174
00:10:37,553 --> 00:10:39,305
Boundaries, oo.

175
00:10:40,556 --> 00:10:42,266
Di 'yon pagiging makasarili, Jo.

176
00:10:43,184 --> 00:10:45,853
Okay. Boundaries.

177
00:10:49,023 --> 00:10:49,982
Heto.

178
00:10:51,233 --> 00:10:52,193
'Yong isang kamay.

179
00:10:54,987 --> 00:10:56,947
Huminga tayo, okay?

180
00:10:57,031 --> 00:10:57,907
Malalim na hinga.

181
00:10:59,867 --> 00:11:03,079
Two, three, four, hold.

182
00:11:03,788 --> 00:11:04,664
Exhale.

183
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:11,379
{\an8}Ikaw ang magdedesisyon.

184
00:11:11,462 --> 00:11:13,089
{\an8}Ako ang magdedesisyon.

185
00:11:13,172 --> 00:11:18,219
{\an8}Isa pa, inhale, two, three, four.

186
00:11:18,302 --> 00:11:19,303
Hold.

187
00:11:27,686 --> 00:11:29,563
[busina ng barko]

188
00:11:29,647 --> 00:11:31,065
[hampas ng mga alon]

189
00:11:36,695 --> 00:11:38,447
[malungkot na musika]

190
00:11:46,664 --> 00:11:49,250
[busina ng barko]

191
00:12:07,309 --> 00:12:08,519
[ugong ng sasakyan]

192
00:12:10,062 --> 00:12:11,480
[lagitik ng apoy]

193
00:12:16,110 --> 00:12:17,486
Putik!

194
00:12:17,570 --> 00:12:18,863
[tumatawa]

195
00:12:18,946 --> 00:12:19,989
Sayang!

196
00:12:20,072 --> 00:12:20,990
Wala na.

197
00:12:22,158 --> 00:12:24,743
Tawa-tawa ka pa d'yan. Sayang 'yon.

198
00:12:34,170 --> 00:12:35,546
Di ka ba naiinip dito?

199
00:12:38,466 --> 00:12:42,845
Alam mo, di naman nakakainip
ang mabuhay nang mapayapa.

200
00:12:46,557 --> 00:12:48,017
Ikaw, matanong kita.

201
00:12:48,767 --> 00:12:50,519
Ano ba ang meron doon na wala dito?

202
00:12:51,729 --> 00:12:52,563
Saan?

203
00:12:53,731 --> 00:12:54,607
Sa Amerika.

204
00:12:55,733 --> 00:12:57,359
May TV rin naman dito.

205
00:12:57,443 --> 00:12:59,570
Pare-parehas lang naman din 'yong palabas.

206
00:13:03,073 --> 00:13:05,534
Ano bang punto mo, Renato?

207
00:13:06,785 --> 00:13:08,954
Bakit kinakailangan mo kaming iwan?

208
00:13:15,211 --> 00:13:17,379
Madali lang naman remedyuhan, di ba?

209
00:13:18,130 --> 00:13:24,136
'Yong ganito, 'yong ganyan, imbes na
aalis ka na lang nang pabigla-bigla.

210
00:13:27,973 --> 00:13:31,227
Akala mo ba wala lang sa akin 'yon?
Sa anak mo?

211
00:13:34,104 --> 00:13:35,773
Di n'yo lang ako maiintindihan.

212
00:13:36,273 --> 00:13:40,736
O, e di sana, bago ka umalis,
pinaliwanag mo muna sa akin.

213
00:13:46,116 --> 00:13:48,410
Di ko na kilala ang sarili ko no'n.

214
00:13:52,248 --> 00:13:54,416
Sana kilala mo na ang sarili mo ngayon.

215
00:14:05,302 --> 00:14:06,720
{\an8}'Tang ina!

216
00:14:06,804 --> 00:14:07,638
[tumilapong gamot]

217
00:14:07,721 --> 00:14:10,975
Ay, 'tang ina! 'Tang ina!

218
00:14:13,227 --> 00:14:15,020
[kalansing ng bote ng gamot]

219
00:14:15,104 --> 00:14:16,272
Puta!

220
00:14:51,390 --> 00:14:52,474
Lintik!

221
00:15:05,988 --> 00:15:07,531
[napasigaw sa gulat]

222
00:15:07,615 --> 00:15:08,616
Putang ina mo!

223
00:15:08,699 --> 00:15:09,617
[sumisigaw]

224
00:15:10,326 --> 00:15:11,410
Ha!

225
00:15:11,493 --> 00:15:13,162
'Yon ba… Joanne?

226
00:15:13,954 --> 00:15:15,039
[Paz, pasigaw] Joanne!

227
00:15:16,665 --> 00:15:18,876
Joanne! Joanne!

228
00:15:18,959 --> 00:15:20,210
[napasigaw sa gulat]

229
00:15:20,294 --> 00:15:21,503
[nabilaukan]

230
00:15:25,215 --> 00:15:26,258
Joanne!

231
00:15:27,676 --> 00:15:30,304
Joanne! Ako 'to!

232
00:15:32,097 --> 00:15:34,516
Bakit di mo sinabi sa aking darating ka?

233
00:15:36,143 --> 00:15:37,144
Joanne!

234
00:15:37,227 --> 00:15:38,479
Umiihi!

235
00:15:38,562 --> 00:15:40,856
Joanne! Nakilala mo na ba ang kapatid mo?

236
00:15:41,732 --> 00:15:42,650
Joanne!

237
00:15:44,068 --> 00:15:46,320
Joanne! Lumabas ka na!

238
00:15:47,196 --> 00:15:49,865
Awww, Joanne!

239
00:15:55,663 --> 00:15:58,540
Ah, ang saya-saya ko!

240
00:15:58,624 --> 00:16:02,169
Ang dalawang panganay ko!

241
00:16:02,252 --> 00:16:05,339
-Matty, ito ang ate mo, si Joanne!
-Jo.

242
00:16:05,422 --> 00:16:07,925
Joanne, ito si Matty!

243
00:16:09,343 --> 00:16:12,054
Hay, tingnan mo nga naman!

244
00:16:12,137 --> 00:16:14,306
Ang laki mo na! No'ng huli kitang makita…

245
00:16:14,390 --> 00:16:15,224
Ten ako no'n.

246
00:16:16,141 --> 00:16:17,726
Tingnan mo nga yan, o.

247
00:16:19,311 --> 00:16:21,730
Magkamukhang-magkamukha!

248
00:16:24,149 --> 00:16:26,276
Kamukha mo rin pala ako, 'no?

249
00:16:26,819 --> 00:16:27,987
Maliban sa ilong.

250
00:16:29,154 --> 00:16:32,074
At mukhang ilang taon ka nang
di natutulog.

251
00:16:32,825 --> 00:16:36,620
At kulang ka sa carbs.
Para magkalaman ka naman.

252
00:16:36,704 --> 00:16:39,498
Halika, puwede kang matulog sa kuwarto ko.

253
00:16:40,708 --> 00:16:42,960
-Puwede tayong magkuwentuhan.
-Kuwarto mo?

254
00:16:43,043 --> 00:16:46,797
Oo. Kasya tayo do'n.
Malaki naman 'yong kama.

255
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:50,634
O baka gusto mo ng wine?
Gusto mo ba? O gusto mo ng joint?

256
00:16:50,718 --> 00:16:51,760
Tara na, sige na.

257
00:16:51,844 --> 00:16:52,928
Pagod ako.

258
00:16:53,012 --> 00:16:57,182
Pag-usapan natin ang buhay ko
sa New York, ha? Joanne!

259
00:17:00,519 --> 00:17:02,771
Hay! Sumaryosep kang bata ka!

260
00:17:03,856 --> 00:17:05,691
Aatakihin ako sa 'yo!

261
00:17:05,774 --> 00:17:06,942
Anong oras na baga?

262
00:17:07,651 --> 00:17:08,819
Dito muna ako, 'Nay.

263
00:17:09,445 --> 00:17:10,738
Nando'n sa kuwarto ko, e.

264
00:17:13,949 --> 00:17:15,451
Buti naman umuwi ka.

265
00:17:16,744 --> 00:17:18,162
Sandali, ihi lang ako.

266
00:17:21,373 --> 00:17:23,125
Hanggang kailan daw sila dito?

267
00:17:23,876 --> 00:17:25,544
Malay natin. Ewan!

268
00:17:32,301 --> 00:17:33,177
Bakit…

269
00:17:36,930 --> 00:17:37,806
Bakit…

270
00:17:43,771 --> 00:17:45,147
Mama mo 'yon.

271
00:17:53,489 --> 00:17:54,406
[tilaok ng manok]

272
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:58,494
Aling Kuracha, nuwebe sitenta.
Itaya mo, ha?

273
00:17:58,577 --> 00:18:02,748
[Paz] Ano ba yan lahat sila nakatingin
sa 'kin. Siguro naman di ako nakikilala.

274
00:18:03,332 --> 00:18:04,583
Mukha ka kasing bangaw.

275
00:18:05,125 --> 00:18:05,959
Ito naman!

276
00:18:06,043 --> 00:18:10,255
Uy, ano'ng tawag dito? Itlog na pula!

277
00:18:11,006 --> 00:18:15,344
Cookies! Na-miss ko 'to! Sasarap niyan e!

278
00:18:16,178 --> 00:18:19,431
Hay, Pilipinas na Pilipinas!

279
00:18:19,515 --> 00:18:21,183
-Ang init 'no?
-Ay, gusto ko nito!

280
00:18:22,017 --> 00:18:22,893
Puwedeng isukat?

281
00:18:22,976 --> 00:18:25,312
[tindera] Ma'am, bili na kayo, sombrero!

282
00:18:25,395 --> 00:18:26,772
-Bagay.
-Bagay ba?

283
00:18:26,855 --> 00:18:28,357
Oo, ganda-ganda!

284
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:29,608
-Di ba?
-Bilhin mo na!

285
00:18:29,691 --> 00:18:31,485
[tindera] Itong pula
baka mas bagay sayo 'to.

286
00:18:31,568 --> 00:18:34,154
Si Tita Abby, nandiyan!
Ay, Ate!

287
00:18:34,238 --> 00:18:35,197
[tindera] Ang sungit!

288
00:18:35,739 --> 00:18:36,990
-Bilis.
-Dahan-dahan!

289
00:18:37,074 --> 00:18:38,033
Paz!

290
00:18:38,117 --> 00:18:40,869
-Dahan-dahan, 'yong itlog ko baka mabasag.
-Saan na ba?

291
00:18:40,953 --> 00:18:42,412
Ayan na, heto na nga o.

292
00:18:53,257 --> 00:18:54,091
[Modesta] Jo!

293
00:18:55,384 --> 00:18:57,678
Talupak o, bagong huli!

294
00:18:57,761 --> 00:18:58,887
Laki niyan, 'Nay, ha!

295
00:18:58,971 --> 00:19:01,306
Oo nga. Rene, itong isa puwede daw ikilaw.

296
00:19:05,018 --> 00:19:06,228
Anong oras ka dumating?

297
00:19:06,728 --> 00:19:07,938
Kaninang umaga, Pa.

298
00:19:09,231 --> 00:19:10,149
Good girl.

299
00:19:11,608 --> 00:19:13,610
Nakilala mo na ba 'yong kapatid mo?

300
00:19:15,070 --> 00:19:17,948
Parang napaaga nang labas e.

301
00:19:19,616 --> 00:19:20,534
Parang kuwan ba…

302
00:19:22,744 --> 00:19:24,079
Parang hindi pa hinog.

303
00:19:26,248 --> 00:19:27,583
May kukunin lang ako, Pa.

304
00:19:32,796 --> 00:19:36,550
Ano, Paz? Sabi ko na sa 'yo, di ba?
Makakabangga natin 'yong matandang 'yon.

305
00:19:37,759 --> 00:19:39,845
Kita mo, di ka tatantanan no'n.

306
00:19:40,888 --> 00:19:42,723
Ang talas ng mata.

307
00:19:43,265 --> 00:19:44,099
Teka.

308
00:19:45,017 --> 00:19:47,144
Puro prutas at gulay lang pinamili mo?

309
00:19:48,896 --> 00:19:49,813
Naku!

310
00:19:51,773 --> 00:19:54,401
Ayun! Panalo! May bahaw!

311
00:19:55,527 --> 00:19:56,570
Ayan.

312
00:19:56,653 --> 00:19:59,573
Tamang-tama.
Prituhin ko itong isda, pagkatapos…

313
00:20:00,365 --> 00:20:02,242
Isasabay sa bahaw pagkatapos ano…

314
00:20:03,535 --> 00:20:04,453
Saka ganyan.

315
00:20:04,536 --> 00:20:05,454
Ano?

316
00:20:05,537 --> 00:20:06,747
[kalansing ng kutsilyo]

317
00:20:06,830 --> 00:20:10,250
Klaruhin mo naman, Rene. Diyos ko!
Di kita maintindihan.

318
00:20:10,334 --> 00:20:11,710
-Klaro naman ha!
-[Modesta] Rene!

319
00:20:11,793 --> 00:20:13,170
Si Matty!

320
00:20:14,588 --> 00:20:15,422
Ha?

321
00:20:16,548 --> 00:20:20,010
[Modesta] Ay! Matty! Matty!

322
00:20:20,093 --> 00:20:21,762
Di ka pala marunong lumangoy!

323
00:20:21,845 --> 00:20:25,182
Matty, gano'n, gano'n, gano'n ka!

324
00:20:25,265 --> 00:20:26,725
Rene!

325
00:20:26,808 --> 00:20:28,101
Matty?

326
00:20:28,185 --> 00:20:30,062
-[Jo] Ano'ng nangyayari?
-Diyos ko!

327
00:20:31,813 --> 00:20:33,023
[nakakatensiyong musika]

328
00:20:35,859 --> 00:20:38,737
[tila nariring mula ilalim ng tubig]
Matty, hindi ka marunong lumangoy?

329
00:20:38,820 --> 00:20:42,449
[di maintindihang usapan]

330
00:20:42,532 --> 00:20:46,119
[Modesta, luminaw] Rene, si Matty!

331
00:20:48,872 --> 00:20:50,666
[boses ni Paz] <i>Tarantado. Buwisit ka!</i>

332
00:20:55,128 --> 00:20:57,172
[matinis na ugong na biglang humupa]

333
00:20:57,256 --> 00:20:58,090
{\an8}Matty?

334
00:21:00,968 --> 00:21:02,678
[Paz] Diyos ko! Matty!

335
00:21:04,096 --> 00:21:08,809
Matty! Ano ba'ng pumasok sa isip mo?
Di ka marunong lumangoy!

336
00:21:09,434 --> 00:21:12,604
Puwede kang malunod! Puwede kang mamatay!

337
00:21:12,688 --> 00:21:15,023
-Diyos ko! Puta ka! Gago!
-Kalma lang!

338
00:21:15,107 --> 00:21:16,441
Ang tigas ng ulo mo!

339
00:21:16,525 --> 00:21:23,365
Lagi kang di nakikinig!
Di ka marunong lumangoy! 'Tang ina!

340
00:21:23,949 --> 00:21:25,534
Tigas ng ulo!

341
00:21:25,617 --> 00:21:27,077
-Kalma lang!
-Anong kalma?

342
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:30,330
-Tuturuan ko na lang lumangoy!
-Isa ka pa! Muntik na ngang mamatay!

343
00:21:30,414 --> 00:21:34,042
-Hindi ko naman pababayaan yan e!
-Pare-pareho kayong mga sira-ulo!

344
00:21:34,126 --> 00:21:34,960
Tama na!

345
00:21:35,043 --> 00:21:38,130
'Tang ina, Des, ha! Ilayo mo sa akin
'yang batang 'yan!

346
00:21:38,213 --> 00:21:39,548
[Des] O halika na, halika na.

347
00:21:39,631 --> 00:21:41,800
[Rene] Hindi ko naman pababayaan!
Ano ka ba?

348
00:21:41,883 --> 00:21:42,843
[Des] Tama na!

349
00:21:44,344 --> 00:21:45,721
Kawawa 'yong bata!

350
00:21:45,804 --> 00:21:48,015
[lalaki sa radyo] <i>Maawa po kayo,</i>
<i>wag po!</i>

351
00:21:48,098 --> 00:21:51,601
<i>Kailangan ko lang talaga ng pambili</i>
<i>ng gamot sa nanay ko.</i>

352
00:21:51,685 --> 00:21:54,104
<i>Matagal na po siyang may sakit.</i>

353
00:21:54,187 --> 00:21:57,065
<i>Wala na po akong ibang paraan</i>
<i>para makakuha ng pera!</i>

354
00:21:57,816 --> 00:21:59,318
<i>Maawa na kayo!</i>

355
00:22:01,028 --> 00:22:01,903
<i>Hindi!</i>

356
00:22:01,987 --> 00:22:04,823
Manang, hindi ka pa ba nagsawa
sa dramang 'yan?

357
00:22:06,325 --> 00:22:09,036
<i>Maawa po kayo! Wag po!</i>

358
00:22:10,120 --> 00:22:11,413
[tumutunog na cellphone]

359
00:22:11,997 --> 00:22:12,998
'Nak!

360
00:22:13,498 --> 00:22:15,083
Jo, 'nak!

361
00:22:15,792 --> 00:22:16,960
Telepono mo, o.

362
00:22:18,462 --> 00:22:19,504
'Nay.

363
00:22:30,557 --> 00:22:32,225
Gano'n talaga ang tawagan n'yo?

364
00:22:42,986 --> 00:22:44,696
[Migs] <i>Hello? Saan ka?</i>

365
00:22:44,780 --> 00:22:45,864
San Rafael.

366
00:22:45,947 --> 00:22:49,242
Pumunta ka? Sana sinabi mo
para nasamahan kita.

367
00:22:49,326 --> 00:22:50,702
Bakit ka sasama?

368
00:22:50,786 --> 00:22:54,289
Ah, moral support? Ayos ka lang ba?

369
00:22:54,956 --> 00:22:55,832
Sinusubukan ko.

370
00:22:57,125 --> 00:22:59,461
[Des] 'Nak, malamig na 'yong pagkain!

371
00:23:00,003 --> 00:23:01,046
Mauna na 'ko.

372
00:23:01,129 --> 00:23:02,089
Jo.

373
00:23:05,926 --> 00:23:07,427
Yoohoo!

374
00:23:08,678 --> 00:23:10,138
Maria Paz!

375
00:23:11,723 --> 00:23:13,767
Maria Paz delos Santos!

376
00:23:14,726 --> 00:23:17,437
Di ka na… Di ka na ba aalis?

377
00:23:18,063 --> 00:23:21,858
Kasi kung for good ka dito,
ay maghanda tayo.

378
00:23:21,942 --> 00:23:25,487
Naku, wag na! Ayoko! Magulo!

379
00:23:25,570 --> 00:23:26,988
Hindi, simple lang!

380
00:23:27,072 --> 00:23:28,615
Sino'ng pupunta?

381
00:23:28,698 --> 00:23:29,658
Mga kamag-anak.

382
00:23:31,326 --> 00:23:32,452
Ayoko.

383
00:23:32,536 --> 00:23:35,622
Ayaw mo? O sige, kapatid mo na lang.

384
00:23:36,123 --> 00:23:38,750
At saka 'yong mga kaibigan mong showbiz,
'yong dati.

385
00:23:38,834 --> 00:23:43,130
Naku, imbitahin mo 'yon lalo na 'yong…
Hanggang ngayon napapanood ko sa TV.

386
00:23:43,213 --> 00:23:45,090
'Yong lagi mong kasama noon.

387
00:23:45,173 --> 00:23:48,969
Ngayon sikat na sikat pa rin ha.
Si Stella!

388
00:23:53,807 --> 00:23:55,058
Ninerbiyos ako.

389
00:23:56,184 --> 00:23:57,269
Alam mo?

390
00:23:58,186 --> 00:24:03,775
Kung di nagpunta sa States ang Mama mo,
sikat na artista na siya.

391
00:24:04,818 --> 00:24:08,155
Oo, kasi kasama niya noon si Cherie Gil,

392
00:24:08,905 --> 00:24:11,908
si Gretchen, si Alice Dixon.

393
00:24:11,992 --> 00:24:16,121
At 'yong pinamakamalaking star ngayon,
si Stella Guevarra.

394
00:24:19,749 --> 00:24:20,750
Very nice.

395
00:24:21,626 --> 00:24:23,753
Saan mo ba napulot itong batang 'to?

396
00:24:23,837 --> 00:24:26,965
Ay mahabang kuwento, Tita.
Sa susunod na, ha?

397
00:24:30,385 --> 00:24:31,761
[banayad na ugong ng dagat]

398
00:24:40,520 --> 00:24:42,189
[malabong tunog ng sigawan]

399
00:24:44,566 --> 00:24:46,860
[Paz] <i>Tumahimik ka! Tama na!</i>

400
00:24:48,278 --> 00:24:49,988
[Matty] <i>Di ako bagay dito.</i>

401
00:24:50,071 --> 00:24:53,950
[Paz] <i>Ano'ng gagawin mo?</i>
<i>Titira sa kalsada?</i>

402
00:24:56,369 --> 00:24:58,997
[Matty] <i>Di ako bagay dito.</i>
<i>Ba't mo 'ko dinala dito?</i>

403
00:24:59,080 --> 00:25:04,085
Ano'ng mangyayari sa 'yo do'n?
Ano'ng gagawin mo?

404
00:25:04,169 --> 00:25:06,796
Sa kalsada ka. Wala kang matitirahan…

405
00:25:06,880 --> 00:25:08,089
Wag mo 'kong hawakan!

406
00:25:08,632 --> 00:25:10,759
Wala na tayong babalikan do'n.

407
00:25:10,842 --> 00:25:14,930
Ikaw siguro pero ako mayro'n.
Bakit ikaw palagi ang nasusunod?

408
00:25:16,097 --> 00:25:19,809
Tingin mo ba ililigtas ka ng tatay mo?
Duwag siya!

409
00:25:20,310 --> 00:25:22,771
Ayaw ka na niya. Ako nandito.

410
00:25:23,271 --> 00:25:25,232
Tama na, Matty! Tama na!

411
00:25:26,274 --> 00:25:27,484
Matty, tama na!

412
00:25:28,068 --> 00:25:29,027
Tama na!

413
00:25:29,611 --> 00:25:32,948
Tama na! Tumigil ka na!

414
00:25:34,157 --> 00:25:35,283
[umiiyak at dumadaing]

415
00:25:36,534 --> 00:25:37,827
[sumisinghap]

416
00:25:39,120 --> 00:25:41,623
Nandito ako para sa 'yo!

417
00:25:41,706 --> 00:25:42,582
[humahagulgol]

418
00:25:43,124 --> 00:25:46,878
Ayos lang lahat. Ayos lang.

419
00:25:48,004 --> 00:25:49,005
Sorry.

420
00:25:50,131 --> 00:25:51,466
[dramatikong musika]

421
00:25:54,135 --> 00:25:56,054
[dramatikong musikang lumalakas]

422
00:26:06,147 --> 00:26:08,108
[lagaslas ng tubig]

423
00:26:09,734 --> 00:26:12,904
Eto baga 'yong katambal mo sa pelikula mo?

424
00:26:13,488 --> 00:26:15,031
Oo si… Kenneth!

425
00:26:15,115 --> 00:26:19,160
E bakit ang laki ng umbok?
Parang may braso ng bata. [tawang-tawa]

426
00:26:19,995 --> 00:26:24,582
Binabalot lang nila 'yan ng medyas!
'Yon ang gamit nila. Oo.

427
00:26:29,754 --> 00:26:30,630
Aray.

428
00:26:31,172 --> 00:26:32,674
Ay, ito.

429
00:26:33,800 --> 00:26:35,385
Ang tagal na nito.

430
00:26:37,470 --> 00:26:38,722
[marahang napabulalas]

431
00:26:39,514 --> 00:26:40,890
Ang bata mo pa diyan.

432
00:26:40,974 --> 00:26:43,310
Oo. Tingan mo naman si Joanne.

433
00:26:45,562 --> 00:26:47,480
Oo nga. Sa La Union ba 'yan?

434
00:26:47,564 --> 00:26:48,606
Oo, sa La Union.

435
00:26:50,233 --> 00:26:51,234
Jo, anak.

436
00:26:52,569 --> 00:26:53,486
Joanne.

437
00:26:54,195 --> 00:26:55,155
Tingnan mo.

438
00:26:56,823 --> 00:27:00,744
Tingnan mo. Kabataan 'to ni Modesta!

439
00:27:03,705 --> 00:27:04,873
Ay, tingnan mo!

440
00:27:04,956 --> 00:27:06,750
Wala tayong pictures together, 'no?

441
00:27:07,917 --> 00:27:10,211
Laging ako lang, si Nono at si Nona.

442
00:27:12,547 --> 00:27:13,715
Lagi kang wala.

443
00:27:17,677 --> 00:27:18,511
Di ba?

444
00:27:19,721 --> 00:27:21,556
Ah, ilalabas ko na 'to?

445
00:27:21,639 --> 00:27:23,016
Hmm? Oo.

446
00:27:33,526 --> 00:27:35,612
Sino sa tingin mo ang kumuha ng pictures?

447
00:27:39,991 --> 00:27:41,326
[kalabog ng album sa mesa]

448
00:27:41,910 --> 00:27:43,078
[nabahing]

449
00:27:45,455 --> 00:27:48,208
Modesta, maglinis ka dito.

450
00:27:52,337 --> 00:27:55,840
Kantahan na!
Ate o, andito na 'yong videoke.

451
00:27:56,966 --> 00:27:58,551
-Ate Paz.
-Ano 'yan?

452
00:27:59,177 --> 00:28:01,888
Rene! Sino'ng may pakana niyan?

453
00:28:01,971 --> 00:28:04,391
-Akala ko ba gusto mo ng sounds?
-Music!

454
00:28:04,474 --> 00:28:06,851
Hindi ingay. Ito, ingay!

455
00:28:06,935 --> 00:28:08,436
Sus. Gano'n din naman 'yan.

456
00:28:08,520 --> 00:28:12,482
Nagpakahirap na nga kami.
Halina kayo boys, testingin na natin 'yan.

457
00:28:12,565 --> 00:28:13,483
Puro kalokohan 'to!

458
00:28:13,566 --> 00:28:15,985
-Sounds, di ba? Sounds!
-Anong sounds?

459
00:28:16,069 --> 00:28:18,738
-Masaya 'yan, basta kami bahala!
-Saan n'yo dadalhin 'yan?

460
00:28:18,822 --> 00:28:20,448
Halina kayo boys, ipuwesto na 'yan!

461
00:28:20,532 --> 00:28:22,742
Parang may nakakalimutan tayo… Ice! Ice!

462
00:28:22,826 --> 00:28:24,911
-May ice ba?
-Ate Mylene, mayro'n na?

463
00:28:24,994 --> 00:28:27,539
-'Yong ice! 'Yong ice!
-Mayro'n na!

464
00:28:27,622 --> 00:28:28,873
Ano pa ba?

465
00:28:28,957 --> 00:28:32,502
[lalaki] Ate! Nandito na sila, Ate!

466
00:28:33,044 --> 00:28:34,963
[tunog ng videoke na binuksan]

467
