715
00:40:39,979 --> 00:40:40,855
Paz…

716
00:40:40,938 --> 00:40:43,816
Sino ang T-A-T-A-Y nito?

717
00:40:45,234 --> 00:40:46,110
Hindi ako, ha.

718
00:40:47,153 --> 00:40:48,654
Rene! Hi!

719
00:40:48,737 --> 00:40:49,864
Hi! [nagri-ring na phone]

720
00:40:49,947 --> 00:40:51,240
Kumusta? Long time no see!

721
00:40:51,323 --> 00:40:52,908
Welcome!

722
00:40:52,992 --> 00:40:53,826
Excuse me.

723
00:40:57,997 --> 00:40:58,831
Ano, sis?

724
00:40:58,914 --> 00:41:01,792
[Cake] <i>Uy, good news!</i>
<i>Na-transfer na 'yong TF mo!</i>

725
00:41:01,876 --> 00:41:02,918
Hindi nga?

726
00:41:03,002 --> 00:41:06,338
<i>Oo sabi, check mo balance mo.</i>
<i>Puwede ka na lumipad.</i>

727
00:41:06,422 --> 00:41:07,923
Thank you, ha, thank you!

728
00:41:08,007 --> 00:41:09,425
<i>Sige, bye!</i>

729
00:41:16,474 --> 00:41:18,017
-Hi, Ben.
<i>-What's up, Jo?</i>

730
00:41:18,767 --> 00:41:19,810
Tuloy na 'ko.

731
00:41:19,894 --> 00:41:22,480
<i>Ah, magandang balita! Umabot ka.</i>

732
00:41:23,063 --> 00:41:26,650
<i>Kausap ko no'ng isang araw si Mike</i>
<i>at tingin niya maganda 'yong pitch mo.</i>

733
00:41:26,734 --> 00:41:29,361
<i>Pag nagsabi nang gano'n si Mike, pasok ka.</i>

734
00:41:29,904 --> 00:41:31,906
<i>Tapusin mo na 'yong treatment.</i>

735
00:41:31,989 --> 00:41:33,073
I will!

736
00:41:37,828 --> 00:41:38,871
Fab desserts.

737
00:41:38,954 --> 00:41:42,583
Wow, parang ang lawak ng ngiti, ah!
Hoy, ano yan?

738
00:41:43,751 --> 00:41:45,085
Ano'ng nangyari? Ano 'yon?

739
00:41:45,169 --> 00:41:46,003
Ha?

740
00:41:48,714 --> 00:41:49,715
Nakuha mo?

741
00:41:52,426 --> 00:41:54,178
Wait. Finally?

742
00:41:54,261 --> 00:41:55,179
Yes, Tito.

743
00:41:55,262 --> 00:41:58,516
Oh, my God! Yes! The States! Congrats!

744
00:41:58,599 --> 00:42:00,059
Nakamamatay naman 'to.

745
00:42:00,142 --> 00:42:02,686
Nakuha po siya
for a screenwriting fellowship.

746
00:42:03,312 --> 00:42:06,649
A very prestigious one.
Mahirap makapasok do'n!

747
00:42:10,194 --> 00:42:12,488
-Sobrang excited ko para sa 'yo!
-Congratulations, Jo!

748
00:42:12,571 --> 00:42:13,656
Aalis ka?

749
00:42:15,199 --> 00:42:16,242
Saan?

750
00:42:16,325 --> 00:42:17,284
Brooklyn.

751
00:42:17,368 --> 00:42:18,452
Oh, New York.

752
00:42:19,203 --> 00:42:20,329
Pa'no mo nakuha 'yon?

753
00:42:21,455 --> 00:42:23,123
Sinabi ng kaibigan kong agent.

754
00:42:23,207 --> 00:42:26,043
Nag-apply ako, I got in.

755
00:42:26,126 --> 00:42:28,837
At least may minana kang talent sa akin.

756
00:42:28,921 --> 00:42:31,382
Ang galing! O kailan ka aalis?

757
00:42:32,091 --> 00:42:33,425
-Next month.
-Next month.

758
00:42:37,179 --> 00:42:40,516
Sobrang proud ko sa kaniya.
Pinaghirapan niya 'to.

759
00:42:40,599 --> 00:42:42,226
And napaka-humble niya about it.

760
00:42:43,269 --> 00:42:44,478
Kaninong anak ka nga?

761
00:42:45,437 --> 00:42:47,439
-Ako ho?
-Tita, kaibigan ko po.

762
00:42:49,775 --> 00:42:51,026
Ano'ng trabaho mo?

763
00:42:51,694 --> 00:42:52,820
Psychiatrist po.

764
00:42:52,903 --> 00:42:55,030
Psychiatrist!

765
00:42:55,114 --> 00:42:56,991
[Stella] Ah, doktor ka?

766
00:42:57,074 --> 00:43:00,869
Oo. Naka-focus ako
sa psychosomatic pyschiatry.

767
00:43:04,081 --> 00:43:04,915
Hoy!

768
00:43:05,457 --> 00:43:07,084
Kumain ka muna dito.

769
00:43:07,167 --> 00:43:10,254
Sumubo ka bago ka uminom nang uminom.
Halika dito.

770
00:43:10,337 --> 00:43:12,715
Si Tito Tito ba 'to?

771
00:43:12,798 --> 00:43:14,800
Hindi pa rin nagbabago.

772
00:43:18,137 --> 00:43:19,346
Hi!

773
00:43:23,475 --> 00:43:26,186
-Ano 'to?
-Lechon.

774
00:43:26,270 --> 00:43:29,773
'Yan, sige kumain ka ng maraming taba
para mamatay ka na.

775
00:43:30,941 --> 00:43:33,193
Ang bait mo naman!

776
00:43:33,277 --> 00:43:34,820
Kain ka d'yan, kain ka d'yan.

777
00:43:34,903 --> 00:43:36,196
[Abby] Ayoko niyan!

778
00:43:36,280 --> 00:43:37,698
Parang maliit lang 'yan noon.

779
00:43:37,781 --> 00:43:39,450
-Noon?
-Yeah.

780
00:43:40,159 --> 00:43:41,952
Di mo binisita dito si Papa.

781
00:43:42,036 --> 00:43:45,247
Oh, come on! Kulang ang kuwarto mo dito.

782
00:43:45,331 --> 00:43:47,333
-Retarded ka talaga.
-Sa 'yo pa nanggaling!

783
00:43:47,416 --> 00:43:48,459
Hoy!

784
00:43:48,542 --> 00:43:52,296
Tumigil kayo ha!
Ang bait-bait ng Papa n'yo. Ano ba kayo?

785
00:43:52,379 --> 00:43:53,881
Totoo 'yon.

786
00:43:53,964 --> 00:43:56,634
Ang bait-bait ng Papa n'yo lalo sa chicks.

787
00:43:58,677 --> 00:43:59,595
Di ba?

788
00:44:00,638 --> 00:44:02,640
Tumigil ka nga d'yan!

789
00:44:05,267 --> 00:44:07,561
-Ano?
-Ano? Ba't ka galit?

790
00:44:07,645 --> 00:44:09,730
Si Papa ay depressed na tao.

791
00:44:09,813 --> 00:44:10,856
Depressed-depressed…

792
00:44:11,607 --> 00:44:13,442
Gawa-gawa lang ng mga doktor 'yon!

793
00:44:17,154 --> 00:44:18,155
Tito, 'yong…

794
00:44:18,989 --> 00:44:22,660
depression po kasi, ano,
medical condition po 'yon.

795
00:44:24,495 --> 00:44:25,954
Isa siyang mental disorder.

796
00:44:28,415 --> 00:44:29,291
Gago.

797
00:44:29,958 --> 00:44:31,418
Dati wala namang ganyan.

798
00:44:32,086 --> 00:44:33,545
Kung sabagay…

799
00:44:33,629 --> 00:44:37,132
Oo, kasi lahat puwedeng daanin sa dasal.

800
00:44:37,633 --> 00:44:41,387
Oo, di ba, kailangan natin magdasal.

801
00:44:41,470 --> 00:44:44,640
Ngayon, puwede ring mag-albularyo.

802
00:44:44,723 --> 00:44:46,392
'Yong sambong sa ulo.

803
00:44:48,727 --> 00:44:50,020
Hindi ba?

804
00:44:51,271 --> 00:44:52,856
Tita, okay naman po magdasal.

805
00:44:54,483 --> 00:44:57,820
Kadalasan lang kasi,
'yong anxiety o depression,

806
00:44:58,445 --> 00:45:01,615
'yong mga nakukuha
sa natural reaction sa life.

807
00:45:01,698 --> 00:45:03,700
'Yong pag nawalan ka ng trabaho.

808
00:45:04,993 --> 00:45:06,120
O namatayan.

809
00:45:06,662 --> 00:45:09,873
O kaya minsan,
kapag iniwan ka ng mahal mo sa buhay.

810
00:45:10,457 --> 00:45:13,836
'Yan, you're right,
prayer can be a source of hope.

811
00:45:14,628 --> 00:45:15,462
Di ba?

812
00:45:15,546 --> 00:45:18,382
Kaso lang po, minsan,
kahit anong dasal n'yo,

813
00:45:19,007 --> 00:45:22,052
hindi nawawala ang bigat ng loob mo.
Sakit, 'no?

814
00:45:22,136 --> 00:45:24,221
Or worse, habang nagtatagal,

815
00:45:24,304 --> 00:45:28,100
'yong bigat po na 'yon patindi
nang patindi, di mo na alam kung bakit.

816
00:45:28,976 --> 00:45:32,729
Pag gano'n na po,
'yan ang malalim na 'yong ugat.

817
00:45:33,647 --> 00:45:35,774
'Yan, kailangan mo na magpagamot.

818
00:45:35,858 --> 00:45:37,734
Diyan kayo magaling!

819
00:45:39,111 --> 00:45:40,487
Magbenta ng gamot.

820
00:45:40,988 --> 00:45:42,948
Eh ang dali lang naman sumaya, di ba?

821
00:45:43,740 --> 00:45:45,701
-Uminom, di ba, Rene?
-Oo, pare!

822
00:45:45,784 --> 00:45:47,244
Tawagin si kumpare.

823
00:45:48,036 --> 00:45:51,373
-Videoke, magsabong, pusoy dos!
-Puwede!

824
00:45:53,250 --> 00:45:56,503
Napakaraming paraan para sumaya.

825
00:45:57,004 --> 00:46:00,716
Ay kung talagang sira na ang ulo,
e di ipasok na sa mental.

826
00:46:04,511 --> 00:46:05,929
O, tubig!

827
00:46:06,638 --> 00:46:09,433
[Abby] Wag kang susuka dito, pambihira ka!

828
00:46:09,516 --> 00:46:12,186
Dahil sa ganito kaya
may mga taong nagpapakamatay.

829
00:46:12,269 --> 00:46:13,479
Among other things.

830
00:46:13,562 --> 00:46:14,938
Ano ba, sa labas ka na lang.

831
00:46:15,022 --> 00:46:16,315
Tama na, Matty!

832
00:46:16,899 --> 00:46:17,983
Hoy!

833
00:46:18,066 --> 00:46:20,194
-Ayusin mo 'yan, ha?
-Opo.

834
00:46:21,695 --> 00:46:25,240
Ay naku, 'yan ang kailangan kong dasalan.

835
00:46:25,866 --> 00:46:29,786
Para 'to sa lahat ng babaeng minahal ko.

836
00:46:35,792 --> 00:46:38,795
Kailangan 'ata ipatingin mo na
'yang batang 'yan.

837
00:46:40,464 --> 00:46:42,591
Hay naku, Tita.

838
00:46:42,674 --> 00:46:45,260
Kung ano-anong ingay ang naririnig ko
galing sa kuwarto niyan.

839
00:46:45,344 --> 00:46:48,555
Lakad nang lakad,
tapos nagpapatugtog nang malakas.

840
00:46:48,639 --> 00:46:51,308
Pagod na pagod na ako,
tapos ganyan nang ganyan.

841
00:46:51,391 --> 00:46:53,560
Hindi mapakali, nakakarindi!

842
00:46:53,644 --> 00:46:55,479
Ano'ng sinasabi mo, Ma?

843
00:46:55,562 --> 00:46:58,607
Kinukuwento ko na artist ka rin kagaya ko.

844
00:46:58,690 --> 00:47:00,859
Oh come on, wag kang magsinungaling.

845
00:47:00,943 --> 00:47:04,196
Sabihin mo ang anak mo ay depressed,
bipolar, manic depressive.

846
00:47:04,279 --> 00:47:05,864
Bakit mo 'ko ikinakahiya?

847
00:47:06,615 --> 00:47:08,909
At sabihin mo
na may mga naririnig kang boses.

848
00:47:11,662 --> 00:47:14,998
May mga pangit kang naaalala at pakiramdam
mo inabandona ka ng tatay mo.

849
00:47:15,082 --> 00:47:17,626
Di ka kumakalma
nang wala kang weed o Xanax.

850
00:47:17,709 --> 00:47:19,253
Sabihin mo na! Aminin mo na!

851
00:47:19,336 --> 00:47:21,171
Alam n'yo, gawa-gawa lang niya 'yan.

852
00:47:21,255 --> 00:47:23,382
Sinungaling ang batang 'to.

853
00:47:23,465 --> 00:47:26,802
Imagine, 20 years ko na 'tong tinitiis.

854
00:47:26,885 --> 00:47:29,846
Sino ba kasi ang T-A-T-A-Y niya?

855
00:47:29,930 --> 00:47:31,598
Tumahimik ka na nga.

856
00:47:31,682 --> 00:47:34,184
Alam ko kung ano ang T-A-T-A-Y.

857
00:47:34,268 --> 00:47:37,479
Gusto n'yong malaman nasaan ang tatay ko?
Hindi ko alam.

858
00:47:37,563 --> 00:47:40,732
Baka nasa kulungan. O baka patay na siya
o lasing sa kung saan.

859
00:47:40,816 --> 00:47:43,694
O may masayang pamilya.
Di niya inaaming buhay ako.

860
00:47:44,236 --> 00:47:47,531
Tinitiis lang lahat ng nanay ko
kasi malaki ang ibinayad sa kanya.

861
00:47:47,614 --> 00:47:49,741
At sino ang apektado? Ako.

862
00:47:51,493 --> 00:47:52,703
May tanong pa kayo?

863
00:47:53,203 --> 00:47:54,955
Putang ina mo!

864
00:47:55,747 --> 00:47:56,915
Putang ina!

865
00:47:57,708 --> 00:48:01,128
Matapos lahat ng pinagdaanan ko
para sa 'yo ito ang makukuha ko?

866
00:48:01,211 --> 00:48:05,591
Wala kang alam.
Lintik na walang utang na loob.

867
00:48:06,133 --> 00:48:09,136
Ano sa tingin mo
ang ginawa ko para mabuhay tayo

868
00:48:09,219 --> 00:48:12,639
kung di ako nagsakripisyo para sa 'yo?
Para sa 'yo lahat 'yon, Matty!

869
00:48:14,474 --> 00:48:16,101
Saan ka pupulutin kung wala ako?

870
00:48:16,184 --> 00:48:19,146
At gusto mong bumalik sa Amerika? Sige.

871
00:48:19,229 --> 00:48:22,691
Tingnan mo kung kaya mong mabuhay ng
isang araw. Ni di ka marunong lumangoy!

872
00:48:22,774 --> 00:48:24,693
-Kailangan ba talaga magsigawan?
-Oo!

873
00:48:25,611 --> 00:48:27,696
O, di ba?

874
00:48:27,779 --> 00:48:29,698
Labas na lahat ng baho ko, di ba?

875
00:48:29,781 --> 00:48:31,992
O, wag kayong umalis! Dito lang kayo!

876
00:48:32,075 --> 00:48:33,910
Ayokong may mapalampas kayo.

877
00:48:35,495 --> 00:48:39,666
'Yon naman ang ipinunta n'yo, di ba?
Ang makiusyoso.

878
00:48:40,208 --> 00:48:42,419
Hoy, Tita Abby.

879
00:48:42,502 --> 00:48:46,131
Gusto mo talaga malaman
kung bakit ako umuwi? Ha?

880
00:48:47,215 --> 00:48:48,425
Ang kulit mo e.

881
00:48:48,925 --> 00:48:52,638
♪ <i>Sabihin na, isigaw na ♪</i>

882
00:48:52,721 --> 00:48:54,556
Puta. Goddammit!

883
00:48:56,850 --> 00:49:02,731
♪ <i>Isigaw na, ilabas na</i>
<i>Isigaw na, ila— ♪</i>

884
00:49:02,814 --> 00:49:04,524
[biglang pagtigil ng videoke]

885
00:49:12,658 --> 00:49:14,368
[banayad na paghampas ng mga alon]

886
00:49:16,203 --> 00:49:17,412
May cancer ako.

887
00:49:21,458 --> 00:49:22,793
At umuwi ako para mamatay.

888
00:49:44,481 --> 00:49:45,691
[Paz] Pahingi ng lighter.

889
00:50:00,455 --> 00:50:01,915
[pagkaskas ng silya sa sahig]

890
00:50:02,457 --> 00:50:03,542
[malungkot na musika]

891
00:50:10,966 --> 00:50:12,426
[banayad na hampas ng alon]

892
00:50:17,681 --> 00:50:19,891
[lagitik ng baga ng apoy]

893
00:50:28,900 --> 00:50:29,901
Gusto mo?

894
00:50:32,529 --> 00:50:33,447
Ayos lang.

895
00:50:40,787 --> 00:50:43,331
Kakaloka 'yong eksena mo kanina.

896
00:50:46,543 --> 00:50:47,669
Di ako ang nagsimula.

897
00:50:53,925 --> 00:50:55,302
Gaano katagal mo nang alam?

898
00:50:57,846 --> 00:50:59,055
Mga isang taon na.

899
00:51:03,643 --> 00:51:04,936
Anong stage?

900
00:51:07,564 --> 00:51:08,607
End stage.

901
00:51:08,690 --> 00:51:09,733
Ano?

902
00:51:14,738 --> 00:51:15,655
Chemo?

903
00:51:16,198 --> 00:51:17,908
Iniisip mo bang mag-chemo?

904
00:51:19,326 --> 00:51:20,368
Sinubukan ko na.

905
00:51:21,328 --> 00:51:24,289
Lalo lang… akong nagkasakit.

906
00:51:31,922 --> 00:51:32,923
Pero ito…

907
00:51:36,885 --> 00:51:38,512
Nakakabuti sa pakiramdam.

908
00:51:42,641 --> 00:51:44,059
[malalim na buntong-hininga]

909
00:51:50,148 --> 00:51:52,651
You're gonna outlast me again 'no, bruha?

910
00:51:52,734 --> 00:51:53,693
Bruha ka e.

911
00:51:57,364 --> 00:51:58,198
Paz…

912
00:52:01,576 --> 00:52:02,911
sana alam mo…

913
00:52:03,787 --> 00:52:07,499
that I sincerely, genuinely
look up to you.

914
00:52:10,502 --> 00:52:12,712
You make me sound old, ano ka ba?

915
00:52:12,796 --> 00:52:14,464
Seryoso ako!

916
00:52:16,883 --> 00:52:17,843
Look at you.

917
00:52:18,927 --> 00:52:20,595
Ginagawa mo ang gusto mong gawin.

918
00:52:21,763 --> 00:52:23,014
No apologies.

919
00:52:23,098 --> 00:52:25,392
Wala kang pakialam sa ibang tao.

920
00:52:26,142 --> 00:52:28,186
Sana ganyan din ako.

921
00:52:28,270 --> 00:52:29,688
Uy, teka.

922
00:52:29,771 --> 00:52:31,857
Tinutupad mo ang pangarap mo.

923
00:52:32,983 --> 00:52:33,859
Ako?

924
00:52:34,401 --> 00:52:37,529
Tingnan mo 'ko?
Matandang babaeng namamatay sa cancer.

925
00:52:38,947 --> 00:52:40,365
Ano'ng sinasabi mo?

926
00:52:41,366 --> 00:52:42,701
Ikaw nga diyan e,

927
00:52:43,243 --> 00:52:45,620
gumagawa ka ng pelikula sa Amerika.

928
00:52:45,704 --> 00:52:47,455
Pangarap 'yan ng lahat ng artista.

929
00:52:47,539 --> 00:52:48,748
Isa lang 'yon.

930
00:52:49,457 --> 00:52:50,584
Hindi ko pa natapos.

931
00:52:52,252 --> 00:52:54,796
You heard Matty.
Hinampas ko 'yong direktor.

932
00:52:58,466 --> 00:52:59,718
Hinarass ka?

933
00:53:10,061 --> 00:53:11,021
[biglang napadaing]

934
00:53:11,646 --> 00:53:12,564
Ayos ka lang?

935
00:53:14,941 --> 00:53:16,902
Uy, Paz.

936
00:53:21,156 --> 00:53:23,950
Bakit nangyayari ang masasamang bagay
sa mabubuting tao?

937
00:53:30,707 --> 00:53:32,292
Ba't ka natatawa?

938
00:53:32,375 --> 00:53:35,503
[tumatawa] Di ko akalain
na maririnig ko 'yan sa 'yo.

939
00:53:36,588 --> 00:53:38,798
What? Ang sama mo naman!

940
00:53:50,560 --> 00:53:51,937
[tumutunog na cellphone]

941
00:53:54,564 --> 00:53:55,774
[malungkot na musika]

942
00:54:09,454 --> 00:54:11,498
[patuloy ang malungkot na musika]

943
00:54:19,255 --> 00:54:22,008
[busina ng barko]

944
00:55:13,518 --> 00:55:16,396
[huni ng mga ibon]

945
00:55:17,564 --> 00:55:19,983
[kaluskos ng mga dahon sa hangin]

946
00:55:32,662 --> 00:55:34,956
Des, kumuha ka ng tubig.

947
00:55:37,333 --> 00:55:38,835
Ah, Miguel.

948
00:55:41,671 --> 00:55:43,089
Ito. Masarap ito.

949
00:55:56,144 --> 00:55:57,604
Saan ka nagpunta?

950
00:55:57,687 --> 00:55:58,563
Nag-drive.

951
00:56:01,900 --> 00:56:02,901
Iniwan mo ako dito.

952
00:56:05,737 --> 00:56:07,655
Hindi din naman kita inimbita, di ba?

953
00:56:17,415 --> 00:56:18,708
Ayan. Thank you.

954
00:56:22,420 --> 00:56:24,506
Kailangan nating pumunta sa doktor.

955
00:56:25,632 --> 00:56:28,510
Bakit? May sakit ka?

956
00:56:28,593 --> 00:56:29,427
Para sa 'yo.

957
00:56:32,472 --> 00:56:34,516
Tumigil ka na, Joanne.

958
00:56:35,517 --> 00:56:37,936
Hindi. Kasi kailangan nating malaman…

959
00:56:38,019 --> 00:56:39,854
Kung ano? Kung tatagal pa ako?

960
00:56:39,938 --> 00:56:41,356
Hindi. Kung ano'ng gagawin.

961
00:56:41,856 --> 00:56:43,399
Sino'ng humingi ng opinyon mo?

962
00:56:44,192 --> 00:56:45,652
Nasa sa akin 'yon, di ba?

963
00:56:46,152 --> 00:56:47,654
Aalagaan ko ang sarili ko.

964
00:56:48,446 --> 00:56:51,866
Sa ngayon, maghihintay ako
hanggang sa mamatay ako.

965
00:56:53,243 --> 00:56:55,620
Des, sumama ka na.
Dito ka na kumain. Sige na.

966
00:56:56,246 --> 00:56:57,914
Bakit kasi ayaw mong magpa-check?

967
00:56:58,998 --> 00:57:00,542
Wala namang mawawala sa 'yo.

968
00:57:01,084 --> 00:57:01,960
Isa ka pa.

969
00:57:04,587 --> 00:57:07,340
Alam n'yo kung bakit?
Pagod na 'ko sa mga doktor

970
00:57:07,423 --> 00:57:09,175
at sa amoy ng mga ospital.

971
00:57:09,259 --> 00:57:11,094
So, please, ha? Puwede ba?

972
00:57:14,681 --> 00:57:16,641
Paano kami makakasigurong totoo 'yan?

973
00:57:19,435 --> 00:57:21,146
Fucking unbelievable.

974
00:57:33,116 --> 00:57:34,534
Ayaw mong maniwala, ha?

975
00:57:35,660 --> 00:57:37,871
Kailangan mo ng pruweba? Okay.

976
00:57:39,706 --> 00:57:40,623
Ayan.

977
00:57:42,417 --> 00:57:43,543
Ayan 'yong pruweba mo.

978
00:57:51,426 --> 00:57:54,804
[Jo, sumisigaw] Pa! Tito! Tulong! Dali!

979
00:57:58,892 --> 00:58:01,936
-'Nay, 'yong bag!
-Magpapa-check up lang tayo.

980
00:58:02,020 --> 00:58:04,856
-Ang tigas ng ulo mo!
-Matty! 'Yong wig ko!

981
00:58:04,939 --> 00:58:06,399
Magpapa-doktor ka!

982
00:58:06,483 --> 00:58:07,567
Nasa akin!

983
00:58:08,443 --> 00:58:09,277
'Nak!

984
00:58:12,572 --> 00:58:15,241
Puwede tayong mag-biopsy para makumpirma.

985
00:58:15,325 --> 00:58:17,076
At makita kung nag-metastasize.

986
00:58:17,744 --> 00:58:19,996
Tapos tingan natin
kung ano'ng puwedeng gawin.

987
00:58:20,580 --> 00:58:24,292
You see, Doctor… Ian.

988
00:58:25,210 --> 00:58:27,670
Alam ko na ang gagawin ko.

989
00:58:27,754 --> 00:58:30,089
Buhay ko, desisyon ko.

990
00:58:39,474 --> 00:58:40,475
Sorry, Dok.

991
00:58:42,769 --> 00:58:44,687
Ma, pa'no kung may mangyari sa 'yo?

992
00:58:45,480 --> 00:58:48,274
Nangyayari na nga. Tanga.

993
00:58:50,902 --> 00:58:54,614
Ba't di na lang natin pagkatiwalaan
ang diagnosis ng experts sa New York?

994
00:58:54,697 --> 00:58:57,492
Ayan na sa harapan n'yo.
Basahin n'yo na lang.

995
00:58:59,077 --> 00:59:02,497
At di ko na babayaran 'tong babaeng
may panlalaking pangalan

996
00:59:02,580 --> 00:59:05,667
para malaman ang alam ko na.

997
00:59:09,587 --> 00:59:11,005
-[Rene] Umm.
-Hay.

998
00:59:11,089 --> 00:59:12,382
Actually, Ma'am.

999
00:59:13,424 --> 00:59:17,303
we have treatments here that have helped
a lot of patients like her.

1000
00:59:18,846 --> 00:59:21,057
Cases of remission in the last 10 years…

1001
00:59:22,016 --> 00:59:23,309
Remission my foot!

1002
00:59:23,851 --> 00:59:24,686
Gago ka ba?

1003
00:59:27,146 --> 00:59:29,941
At di ko iniwan ang lahat sa New York

1004
00:59:30,024 --> 00:59:32,527
para mabulok sa ganitong ospital.

1005
00:59:32,610 --> 00:59:33,987
Niloloko mo ba 'ko?

1006
00:59:36,656 --> 00:59:40,994
[babaeng nag-aanunsiyo sa PA system]
<i>Paging Doctor Liway. Your patient 214…</i>

1007
00:59:41,077 --> 00:59:42,161
Sorry, Dok.

1008
00:59:51,170 --> 00:59:52,380
Dok, puwedeng magtanong?

1009
00:59:53,214 --> 00:59:54,132
Oo naman.

1010
00:59:54,215 --> 00:59:55,174
Gaano katagal?

1011
00:59:57,135 --> 00:59:59,596
Hindi ko alam ang buong lagay niya.

1012
00:59:59,679 --> 01:00:03,182
Pero gaya ng sabi ko, may ilang kaso…

1013
01:00:07,520 --> 01:00:08,771
Base dito.

1014
01:00:11,232 --> 01:00:12,942
Baka tatlo hanggang anim na buwan.

1015
01:00:17,989 --> 01:00:19,282
Ano'ng gagawin ngayon?

1016
01:00:21,242 --> 01:00:22,952
Sa probinsiya kayo nakatira, di ba?

1017
01:00:23,578 --> 01:00:25,288
Puwede kayong magpa-hospice care.

1018
01:00:26,748 --> 01:00:28,458
Wala kaming sapat na pera.

1019
01:00:30,209 --> 01:00:33,129
Kung gano'n, kayo ang mag-aalaga sa kanya.

1020
01:00:39,802 --> 01:00:41,095
Ito po 'yong total natin.

1021
01:01:01,282 --> 01:01:02,325
O…

1022
01:01:02,408 --> 01:01:03,284
Kain na.

1023
01:01:06,079 --> 01:01:07,747
[kalansing ng tinidor sa plato]

1024
01:01:09,290 --> 01:01:10,458
Kailangan mong kumain.

1025
01:01:19,384 --> 01:01:20,468
Hmm.

1026
01:01:30,645 --> 01:01:31,854
[naduduwal]

1027
01:01:31,938 --> 01:01:33,940
Tissue! Tissue, please!

1028
01:01:37,276 --> 01:01:38,653
Tubig.

1029
01:01:39,654 --> 01:01:40,655
I'm sorry.

1030
01:01:42,198 --> 01:01:43,574
Di ko kaya. Pasensiya na.

1031
01:01:46,244 --> 01:01:48,705
Matias, ano na naman?

1032
01:01:49,247 --> 01:01:50,623
Pasensiya na.

1033
01:01:50,707 --> 01:01:52,291
Pero Ma, gusto mo 'to.

1034
01:01:52,375 --> 01:01:54,210
Kahit noon sa New York, kinakain mo 'to.

1035
01:01:54,293 --> 01:01:57,964
At puro 'to taba at kemikal
pero kinakain mo pa rin.

1036
01:01:58,047 --> 01:02:00,049
Pinapakain mo sa 'kin 'to no'ng bata ako

1037
01:02:00,133 --> 01:02:04,137
at nagpapanggap akong gusto ko para sa 'yo
kaya puwedeng magpanggap ka rin ngayon?

1038
01:02:08,808 --> 01:02:10,268
Ilang araw ka nang di kumakain.

1039
01:02:10,351 --> 01:02:13,020
At pag di ka kumain,
lalo kang mangangayayat

1040
01:02:13,104 --> 01:02:14,689
at sobrang payat mo na.

1041
01:02:14,772 --> 01:02:16,649
At ikaw ay…

1042
01:02:17,525 --> 01:02:18,818
Matias.

1043
01:02:18,901 --> 01:02:20,319
Tingnan mo 'ko.

1044
01:02:21,195 --> 01:02:22,447
At mamatay ako.

1045
01:02:24,073 --> 01:02:25,116
[humahagulgol]

1046
01:02:29,662 --> 01:02:31,873
[tunog ng gitara]

1047
01:02:53,144 --> 01:02:56,272
[Jo] "My mother has cancer…"

1048
01:03:57,333 --> 01:04:01,254
Tita, thank you, ha. Thank you talaga.
Thank you!

1049
01:04:01,337 --> 01:04:04,924
Oo naman. Anytime. Basta makakatulong.

1050
01:04:06,092 --> 01:04:09,428
O basta kung may kailangan ka pa,
just let me know. Okay?

1051
01:04:12,014 --> 01:04:13,474
Alam mo, mabuti kang anak.

1052
01:04:18,396 --> 01:04:19,856
Puwede ba 'kong magtanong?

1053
01:04:20,606 --> 01:04:21,440
Oo naman.

1054
01:04:22,692 --> 01:04:24,151
Bakit ang bait mo sa kanya?

1055
01:04:26,404 --> 01:04:28,698
Dahil alam kong gano'n lang talaga siya.

1056
01:04:30,950 --> 01:04:32,076
Alam mo, ang Nanay mo…

1057
01:04:33,828 --> 01:04:35,538
di madali ang naging buhay niya.

1058
01:04:49,635 --> 01:04:54,307
Alam mo, your Mom and I,
we go a long way back.

1059
01:04:55,099 --> 01:04:57,768
Nagkasama kami sa isang project.

1060
01:04:57,852 --> 01:05:00,521
Pareho kaming agogo dancer.
Pareho kaming prosti.

1061
01:05:01,022 --> 01:05:06,152
Tapos meron kaming sobrang
bruskong pulpol na AD.

1062
01:05:06,694 --> 01:05:08,154
At sa di malamang dahilan,

1063
01:05:08,696 --> 01:05:11,115
tuwing magpapalit ako ng costume,

1064
01:05:11,198 --> 01:05:14,368
pumapasok 'tong AD na 'to
sa loob ng tent ko.

1065
01:05:15,328 --> 01:05:19,707
E finally, putsa, hinipuan niya 'ko at…

1066
01:05:20,333 --> 01:05:22,418
pumasok ang Nanay mo sa tent ko.

1067
01:05:22,501 --> 01:05:24,712
Nakita niya lahat at, siyempre,

1068
01:05:24,795 --> 01:05:28,299
hinampas niya ng upuan sa ulo 'yong AD.

1069
01:05:28,382 --> 01:05:31,636
She was so livid,
nanlilisik 'yong mga mata niya!

1070
01:05:32,386 --> 01:05:34,055
Kaya,

1071
01:05:34,138 --> 01:05:36,891
'yong Nanay mo, ipinaglalaban ang tama.

1072
01:05:38,225 --> 01:05:39,852
At kay Paz…

1073
01:05:40,937 --> 01:05:42,772
what she feels is what you get.

1074
01:05:44,357 --> 01:05:46,192
Kaya di siya popular.

1075
01:05:46,275 --> 01:05:48,402
Maraming may ayaw sa kanya.

1076
01:05:50,404 --> 01:05:51,489
Pero at least,

1077
01:05:52,114 --> 01:05:53,074
hindi siya plastik.

1078
01:05:57,912 --> 01:05:59,622
Mainitin lang talaga ang ulo niya.

1079
01:06:00,122 --> 01:06:03,000
Nakakatakot magalit ang Nanay mo.

1080
01:06:03,084 --> 01:06:05,294
Sana di mo 'yon namana.

1081
01:06:17,807 --> 01:06:20,059
Miguel, ano 'yan?

1082
01:06:22,228 --> 01:06:24,438
Migs, pakiakyat na lang sa kuwarto.

1083
01:06:29,402 --> 01:06:30,361
Medical supplies.

1084
01:06:30,444 --> 01:06:31,362
Para kanino?

1085
01:06:32,071 --> 01:06:36,283
Binilhan kita ng tramadol, morphine…

1086
01:06:36,784 --> 01:06:38,411
Madami 'yan, saka 'tong mga 'to.

1087
01:06:39,412 --> 01:06:40,788
Pa'no mo nakuha 'to?

1088
01:06:40,871 --> 01:06:42,707
'Yong oxygen tank nasa taas

1089
01:06:43,457 --> 01:06:45,459
kung sakaling mahirapan ka ulit huminga.

1090
01:06:46,419 --> 01:06:49,171
May cancer ako sa atay, hindi sa baga.

1091
01:06:53,134 --> 01:06:54,010
Joanne.

1092
01:06:54,885 --> 01:06:56,262
Sagutin mo 'ko.

1093
01:06:56,345 --> 01:06:57,638
Sa'n mo kinuha ang pera?

1094
01:06:59,432 --> 01:07:01,225
Joanne, kinakausap kita.

1095
01:07:01,308 --> 01:07:05,438
Pagod na pagod na ako.
Please bukas na lang tayo mag-away.

1096
01:07:05,980 --> 01:07:06,939
Okay lang?

1097
01:07:07,023 --> 01:07:08,566
Hindi kita inaaway.

1098
01:07:10,776 --> 01:07:14,113
It's fine. Itong mga 'to, okay na 'yan.
Bayad na lahat 'yan.

1099
01:07:14,905 --> 01:07:16,574
Nanlimos ka ba?

1100
01:07:16,657 --> 01:07:17,908
Jesus Christ.

1101
01:07:19,035 --> 01:07:20,578
Nakakahiya!

1102
01:07:21,370 --> 01:07:24,665
Ibalik mo 'to! Di ako charity!

1103
01:07:24,749 --> 01:07:26,500
Buti nga may tumutulong pa sa 'yo.

1104
01:07:26,584 --> 01:07:27,877
Di ako humingi ng tulong.

1105
01:07:27,960 --> 01:07:29,462
Well, kailangan mo ng tulong!

1106
01:07:31,839 --> 01:07:32,757
Alam mo?

1107
01:07:33,549 --> 01:07:35,342
Di ko gagamitin 'to.

1108
01:07:35,426 --> 01:07:36,302
Ibalik mo na.

1109
01:07:36,844 --> 01:07:37,887
Wala akong pakialam!

1110
01:07:37,970 --> 01:07:39,430
[kalansing ng gamot sa sahig]

1111
01:07:49,398 --> 01:07:50,316
Tulungan na kita.

1112
01:07:51,025 --> 01:07:52,860
Hindi. Ako na.

1113
01:07:56,614 --> 01:07:58,699
-Tulungan na kita.
-Hindi na, ako na…

1114
01:08:00,201 --> 01:08:01,994
Ako na. Okay na.

1115
01:08:15,216 --> 01:08:17,134
[lalaking nag-aanunsiyo sa PA system]

1116
01:08:21,639 --> 01:08:23,390
[busina ng barko]

1117
01:08:23,474 --> 01:08:25,142
Sige na, baka maiwan ka pa.

1118
01:09:10,771 --> 01:09:15,151
{\an8}Sequence 20. Si Ligaya
nakaupo sa kama at nakatitig sa kisame.

1119
01:09:16,610 --> 01:09:18,821
Sobrang lakas ng hangin sa labas.

1120
01:09:19,572 --> 01:09:22,241
May humahampas sa pader.

1121
01:09:22,867 --> 01:09:28,122
Pero biglang naging tunog ng pagkatok
'yong paghampas sa pader.

1122
01:09:29,081 --> 01:09:30,958
Natakot siya noong una.

1123
01:09:33,586 --> 01:09:37,006
Pero naisip niya
na baka 'yon na nga ang espiritu niya.

1124
01:09:38,174 --> 01:09:41,343
Dahan-dahan siyang tumayo,
pumunta sa pinto…

1125
01:09:41,427 --> 01:09:42,928
[mapanuksong ungol]

1126
01:09:45,806 --> 01:09:47,141
Sorry.

1127
01:09:47,224 --> 01:09:49,143
Gusto ko lang magpasalamat.

1128
01:09:51,687 --> 01:09:52,521
Para saan?

1129
01:09:53,606 --> 01:09:54,773
Sa pagsagip sa akin.

1130
01:09:59,528 --> 01:10:00,654
Busy ako.

1131
01:10:00,738 --> 01:10:01,739
Tahimik lang ako.

1132
01:10:05,576 --> 01:10:07,536
Kumusta ka naman?

1133
01:10:08,287 --> 01:10:09,872
Akala ko ba quiet?

1134
01:10:18,672 --> 01:10:22,176
Ano'ng sinusulat mo? Pelikula?

1135
01:10:22,259 --> 01:10:23,802
-Mm-hmm.
-Nice!

1136
01:10:25,638 --> 01:10:26,764
Ano'ng kuwento?

1137
01:10:28,307 --> 01:10:29,767
-Ano? Ng pelikula?
-Oo.

1138
01:10:34,188 --> 01:10:35,814
Tungkol sa babae…

1139
01:10:37,358 --> 01:10:40,194
na nagluluksa
sa pagkamatay ng kapatid niya.

1140
01:10:41,028 --> 01:10:45,074
At naghahanap siya ng paraan
na makausap ang espiritu niya.

1141
01:10:46,533 --> 01:10:47,660
Paano?

1142
01:10:47,743 --> 01:10:48,577
Anting-anting.

1143
01:10:49,662 --> 01:10:51,038
Alam mo na, isang amulet…

1144
01:10:51,830 --> 01:10:54,458
na nagbibigay ng kapangyarihan
na makausap ang patay.

1145
01:10:55,793 --> 01:10:57,503
At 'yon…

1146
01:11:01,298 --> 01:11:02,258
Di ko pa alam.

1147
01:11:10,766 --> 01:11:12,142
Paano kung…

1148
01:11:13,560 --> 01:11:15,187
Ibang espiritu ang dumating.

1149
01:11:16,772 --> 01:11:20,818
Na dadalhin siya sa direksiyon
na di niya maiisip na gawin.

1150
01:11:22,319 --> 01:11:23,654
Hanggang…

1151
01:11:24,613 --> 01:11:27,658
mahanap niya ang kasagutan.

1152
01:11:46,093 --> 01:11:47,511
Sa'n mo namana ang buhok mo?

1153
01:11:48,846 --> 01:11:49,805
Sa tatay ko.

1154
01:11:50,431 --> 01:11:51,348
Sino'ng tatay mo?

1155
01:11:57,438 --> 01:11:59,898
-Nag-aaral ka pa ba?
-Ha?

1156
01:11:59,982 --> 01:12:01,817
Saan ka nag-aaral?

1157
01:12:03,027 --> 01:12:03,861
Hindi na.

1158
01:12:04,820 --> 01:12:06,155
Nakatapos ako ng grade 12.

1159
01:12:07,531 --> 01:12:09,616
Tapos pinatigil ako ni mama.

1160
01:12:11,493 --> 01:12:12,953
At di na 'ko bumalik.

1161
01:12:16,874 --> 01:12:17,750
Bakit?

1162
01:12:18,500 --> 01:12:20,377
Dahil sa pabago-bago kong mood.

1163
01:12:20,461 --> 01:12:21,920
Mababang grades.

1164
01:12:24,381 --> 01:12:25,299
[sigaw] Mag-ingat ka!

1165
01:12:25,382 --> 01:12:26,550
[napatili sa takot]

1166
01:12:28,552 --> 01:12:30,054
Ano 'yon?

1167
01:12:30,137 --> 01:12:30,971
Wala.

1168
01:12:33,140 --> 01:12:34,058
Gago ka!

1169
01:12:34,141 --> 01:12:35,017
Gago ka!

1170
01:12:39,021 --> 01:12:39,938
[Matty] Malalim ba?

1171
01:12:40,606 --> 01:12:42,649
Uhmm, hindi.

1172
01:12:43,567 --> 01:12:46,403
Lumalangoy ako lagi dito no'ng bata ako.

1173
01:12:47,654 --> 01:12:49,365
Maliit ka pa rin naman.

1174
01:12:50,074 --> 01:12:51,033
Hoy!

1175
01:12:52,493 --> 01:12:53,619
Tama na!

1176
01:12:55,204 --> 01:12:56,747
Sabi niya matigas ang ulo mo.

1177
01:12:58,332 --> 01:12:59,249
Ako?

1178
01:12:59,875 --> 01:13:01,126
Ako pa ngayon, ha.

1179
01:13:02,795 --> 01:13:03,670
Wow.

1180
01:13:07,800 --> 01:13:10,052
Sinubukan ko siyang kausapin.

1181
01:13:10,135 --> 01:13:12,888
Nagpadala ako ng mga email,
pero walang sagot.

1182
01:13:14,056 --> 01:13:15,724
Kaya tumigil na 'ko.

1183
01:13:24,274 --> 01:13:26,110
I'm good. Okay lang ako.

1184
01:13:36,620 --> 01:13:37,538
[Jo] Diyos ko.

1185
01:13:43,877 --> 01:13:45,838
O, basta, tandaan mo

1186
01:13:45,921 --> 01:13:48,424
kapag malalim, una ang ulo.

1187
01:13:49,341 --> 01:13:50,843
Pagkatapos no'n,

1188
01:13:50,926 --> 01:13:55,013
gawin mo 'yong bukakang palaka, ganito.

1189
01:13:55,097 --> 01:13:57,015
And then lulutang ka no'n.

1190
01:13:57,099 --> 01:13:58,016
Ha?

1191
01:13:58,100 --> 01:14:00,060
Pagkatapos no'n, otso-otso.

1192
01:14:01,103 --> 01:14:02,020
Tanchi!

1193
01:14:02,604 --> 01:14:05,190
Samahan mo 'ko sa pulo,
turuan natin 'tong lumangoy.

1194
01:14:05,274 --> 01:14:06,150
Sir?

1195
01:14:07,443 --> 01:14:10,028
Alam mo, sobrang astig mong tatay.

1196
01:14:11,155 --> 01:14:12,823
Lakas tama mo, Tisoy, ha?

1197
01:14:13,407 --> 01:14:14,533
Hindi, seryoso ako.

1198
01:14:14,616 --> 01:14:16,785
Tatawagin na kitang Pops mula ngayon.

1199
01:14:19,580 --> 01:14:20,747
Tayo na!

1200
01:14:21,373 --> 01:14:22,458
O!

1201
01:14:22,541 --> 01:14:23,959
One, two, three!

1202
01:15:10,047 --> 01:15:11,215
Kumusta ang script mo?

1203
01:15:14,218 --> 01:15:15,135
Okay lang.

1204
01:15:18,472 --> 01:15:19,681
Writer's block?

1205
01:15:24,853 --> 01:15:28,023
Naiipit lang ako kasi hindi ko pa alam
kung ano'ng…

1206
01:15:28,106 --> 01:15:29,691
kung ano ang gusto kong ending.

1207
01:15:32,778 --> 01:15:34,655
Kailangan mo bang malaman ang ending?

1208
01:15:37,699 --> 01:15:39,743
Para alam ko kung saan ako pupunta.

1209
01:15:41,119 --> 01:15:42,704
Ang corny naman no'n.

1210
01:15:45,624 --> 01:15:47,543
E di ang pagsusulat ay…

1211
01:15:48,126 --> 01:15:52,130
parang to-do list imbes na,
ano, isang experience.

1212
01:15:55,300 --> 01:15:56,969
Ewan ko, siguro…

1213
01:15:57,052 --> 01:15:59,388
wag ka munang mapako sa isang ending?

1214
01:16:01,348 --> 01:16:03,267
Di ko alam, parang…

1215
01:16:04,685 --> 01:16:05,936
Go with the flow.

1216
01:16:07,354 --> 01:16:09,565
At damhin mo bawat scene.

1217
01:16:12,067 --> 01:16:14,111
At tingnan mo kung saan mapupunta.

1218
01:16:23,078 --> 01:16:24,371
Naaalala mo ba si Nono?

1219
01:16:28,667 --> 01:16:29,543
Oo.

1220
01:16:32,588 --> 01:16:36,383
Gabi-gabi, magpapatugtog 'yon ng plaka

1221
01:16:36,466 --> 01:16:38,468
habang pinapatulog kita.

1222
01:16:40,846 --> 01:16:43,098
Di ko makalimutan sa kanya
'yong tawa niya.

1223
01:16:43,181 --> 01:16:44,683
Parang si Donald Duck.

1224
01:16:58,196 --> 01:17:01,533
Sobrang galing niyang abogado.

1225
01:17:03,869 --> 01:17:05,495
At sobrang galing din na writer.

1226
01:17:08,123 --> 01:17:10,459
Kung alam ko lang noon
ang nalalaman ko ngayon…

1227
01:17:14,087 --> 01:17:16,340
Siguro… Puwedeng…

1228
01:17:24,431 --> 01:17:25,891
Tawag niya sa 'yo "Prinsesa".

1229
01:17:26,516 --> 01:17:27,434
Naaalala mo ba?

1230
01:17:33,065 --> 01:17:34,983
Sobrang proud niya siguro ngayon, Jo.

1231
01:17:52,417 --> 01:17:53,502
Tara na!

1232
01:17:54,044 --> 01:17:55,754
Naglalambing 'yong anak mo!

1233
01:18:09,601 --> 01:18:11,520
[sumisigaw sa tuwa]

1234
01:18:45,804 --> 01:18:48,598
O Paz, uminom ka muna. Baka maulian ka.

1235
01:18:48,682 --> 01:18:49,641
Salamat.

1236
01:18:50,642 --> 01:18:52,728
Kuha tayo ng family picture.

1237
01:18:52,811 --> 01:18:54,521
'Yan! Sige!

1238
01:18:55,230 --> 01:18:56,440
-'Nay
-Ano?

1239
01:18:56,523 --> 01:18:57,607
Picturan mo kami.

1240
01:18:57,691 --> 01:18:59,109
-Pipindutin ko lang?
-Oo

1241
01:18:59,192 --> 01:19:00,736
-Beer ka na naman!
-Isa lang e.

1242
01:19:00,819 --> 01:19:02,904
O everyone look happy, alright!

1243
01:19:04,656 --> 01:19:06,908
Tingin dine. 'Yan.

1244
01:19:09,035 --> 01:19:13,331
-'Yan.
-'Nay, bibilang ka bago mo i-click, ha?

1245
01:19:13,415 --> 01:19:14,624
One, two, three.

1246
01:19:14,708 --> 01:19:16,877
One, two, three, four, five.

1247
01:19:16,960 --> 01:19:18,920
-Ano ba…
-'Nay.

1248
01:19:19,671 --> 01:19:21,089
One, two, three lang.

1249
01:19:21,173 --> 01:19:23,717
-One, two, three, click.
-Click. 'Yon!

1250
01:19:24,926 --> 01:19:28,013
-'Yan, 'yan, 'yan! Smile!
-Kita kaming lahat?

1251
01:19:28,096 --> 01:19:31,183
One, two, three, click.

1252
01:19:31,266 --> 01:19:32,476
Ayan ay kaganda.

1253
01:19:32,559 --> 01:19:34,519
One, two, three, umm!

1254
01:19:34,603 --> 01:19:36,521
-Ayan ang ganda, o!
-Ano 'yong "umm"?

1255
01:19:36,605 --> 01:19:38,565
One, two, three, click. Oh!

1256
01:19:53,997 --> 01:19:55,415
'Tang ina, sakit!

1257
01:20:09,054 --> 01:20:10,764
Papakasalan mo ba 'yong doktor?

1258
01:20:12,390 --> 01:20:14,184
Para may doktor sa bahay.

1259
01:20:16,520 --> 01:20:17,979
Ma, kaibigan ko lang siya.

1260
01:20:20,941 --> 01:20:22,108
Hindi ako tanga.

1261
01:20:23,568 --> 01:20:24,945
Pahinga ka na lang, please.

1262
01:20:26,571 --> 01:20:28,031
Pa'no kayo nagkakilala?

1263
01:20:29,825 --> 01:20:31,159
Pasyente ka ba niya?

1264
01:20:34,830 --> 01:20:35,747
Huli.

1265
01:20:42,504 --> 01:20:44,214
Di kita hinuhusgahan, Jo.

1266
01:20:45,465 --> 01:20:47,926
Ilang doktor na ang nakarelasyon ko.

1267
01:20:52,305 --> 01:20:53,807
Mag-ingat ka lang.

1268
01:21:27,883 --> 01:21:28,884
Ma?

1269
01:21:31,887 --> 01:21:33,805
[dumuduwal]

1270
01:22:13,345 --> 01:22:15,347
[Ben] <i>Uy, ano'ng problema, Jo?</i>

1271
01:22:15,430 --> 01:22:18,558
<i>Bakit biglang di ka na sigurado?</i>

1272
01:22:18,642 --> 01:22:22,062
Pasensiya na, Ben.
Inaalagaan ko 'yong nanay kong may sakit.

1273
01:22:22,145 --> 01:22:25,190
<i>Naku, nalulungkot ako para sa 'yo.</i>

1274
01:22:26,066 --> 01:22:27,400
<i>Bakit di mo sinabi?</i>

1275
01:22:28,234 --> 01:22:30,362
<i>Gusto mo pa bang sumali dito?</i>

1276
01:22:31,071 --> 01:22:34,157
Pinaghirapan ko 'to, Ben.

1277
01:22:36,201 --> 01:22:37,327
Ano'ng gagawin ko?

1278
01:22:38,453 --> 01:22:41,915
<i>Susubukan kong kausapin</i>
<i>ang ilang kaibigan ko…</i>

1279
01:22:41,998 --> 01:22:45,210
Ben, sorry, kailangan ko nang ibaba.

1280
01:22:45,835 --> 01:22:51,967
Pansit ni Choo-wing! Sarap 'to!

1281
01:22:52,050 --> 01:22:54,594
[tunog ng malakas na ulan at kulog]

1282
01:22:59,683 --> 01:23:01,643
-[Paz] Asan na, Rene?
-Ito, ito na!

1283
01:23:04,312 --> 01:23:05,814
[Paz] Wow, thank you.

1284
01:23:07,691 --> 01:23:08,858
Ibigay mo sa ate mo.

1285
01:23:09,484 --> 01:23:10,443
Ito daw sa 'yo.

1286
01:23:12,028 --> 01:23:12,946
Sorry.

1287
01:23:13,488 --> 01:23:14,531
Sa ate mo.

1288
01:23:14,614 --> 01:23:17,283
-Ibigay mo sa ate mo.
-Oo!

1289
01:23:17,367 --> 01:23:19,869
Hindi. Magtatrabaho ako.

1290
01:23:19,953 --> 01:23:22,539
Sige na, Jo. Para sa akin, please.

1291
01:23:22,622 --> 01:23:23,581
Masarap.

1292
01:23:24,833 --> 01:23:26,209
[Paz] Matty, sa 'yo 'to.

1293
01:23:26,918 --> 01:23:28,670
Ayos.

1294
01:23:47,147 --> 01:23:48,773
Dahan-dahan, kasi.

1295
01:23:53,445 --> 01:23:54,904
Hoy, dahan-dahan.

1296
01:23:55,822 --> 01:23:57,407
Sarap! Grabe!

1297
01:23:59,993 --> 01:24:02,620
Nginunguya 'yan. Ano ba sa Ingles 'yon?

1298
01:24:05,248 --> 01:24:08,668
Ma, okay sa 'yo? 'Yong pagkain?

1299
01:24:11,546 --> 01:24:14,299
Ito ang perpektong huling hapunan.

1300
01:24:16,092 --> 01:24:16,968
Ano?

1301
01:24:17,635 --> 01:24:19,137
Di natin alam, di ba?

1302
01:24:20,180 --> 01:24:22,515
Ma, kain na lang.

1303
01:24:23,892 --> 01:24:26,269
Sobrang hindi kayo handa.

1304
01:24:28,521 --> 01:24:31,858
Naisip n'yo na ba
ang sasabihin n'yo sa libing ko?

1305
01:24:37,822 --> 01:24:38,907
Matty boy?

1306
01:24:39,783 --> 01:24:42,160
Sige na, kunwari libing ko.

1307
01:24:42,243 --> 01:24:44,037
Dapat may sabihin ka. Sige na.

1308
01:24:44,579 --> 01:24:46,247
Subukan mo lang, Matias.

1309
01:24:46,748 --> 01:24:47,624
Subukan mo!

1310
01:24:48,374 --> 01:24:50,460
Sige na. Kaya mo 'to.

1311
01:24:51,169 --> 01:24:54,631
Maraming salamat sa lahat
sa pagpunta n'yo.

1312
01:24:54,714 --> 01:24:56,341
Ang lakas ng tama ko ngayon.

1313
01:24:59,803 --> 01:25:02,472
Ngayong gabi, ang mahal kong nanay…

1314
01:25:03,264 --> 01:25:05,016
ay patay na.

1315
01:25:10,563 --> 01:25:12,941
Matty naman!

1316
01:25:13,024 --> 01:25:14,651
Susmaryosep!

1317
01:25:14,734 --> 01:25:16,778
Dapat may sabihin kang maganda.

1318
01:25:16,861 --> 01:25:21,825
Parang, ang nanay ko
ay mapagmahal na tao. Gano'n.

1319
01:25:21,908 --> 01:25:24,828
O masipag siya. Ganyan.

1320
01:25:26,037 --> 01:25:29,124
Hoy, Rene, ikaw ha, kanina ka pa.
Tawa ka nang tawa.

1321
01:25:29,207 --> 01:25:30,041
-Bakit?
-Hoy!

1322
01:25:30,959 --> 01:25:32,418
Ano ba?

1323
01:25:32,502 --> 01:25:33,586
Sige nga.

1324
01:25:36,339 --> 01:25:37,966
Tama na!

1325
01:25:39,717 --> 01:25:41,553
Puta! Sige, sabihin mo na!

1326
01:25:42,387 --> 01:25:43,638
Ito na, ito na.

1327
01:25:43,721 --> 01:25:44,806
[tumitikhim]

1328
01:25:47,684 --> 01:25:48,893
Alam ninyo

1329
01:25:49,435 --> 01:25:52,438
no'ng nagkakilala kami ni Paz,

1330
01:25:52,522 --> 01:25:54,190
sikat na artista na 'yan.

1331
01:25:54,691 --> 01:25:59,529
Palaging nababalita na kung sino-sino
ang dine-date niya.

1332
01:26:00,530 --> 01:26:05,201
Alam ba ninyo
na may dinate pa 'yan na artista?

1333
01:26:07,579 --> 01:26:08,830
Siyempre.

1334
01:26:08,913 --> 01:26:09,789
Naaalala mo?

1335
01:26:10,582 --> 01:26:13,168
Si kuwan. Di ba?

1336
01:26:13,251 --> 01:26:16,129
'Tang ina naman. Patay na ako,
kakausapin mo ko.

1337
01:26:16,713 --> 01:26:17,630
Ano ka ba?

1338
01:26:23,887 --> 01:26:24,929
Diyos ko!

1339
01:26:27,473 --> 01:26:29,267
-Oo nga.
-Nakakaloka.

1340
01:26:29,350 --> 01:26:30,685
Anong klase 'yon, Rene?

1341
01:26:32,812 --> 01:26:35,273
Hoy! Joanne, 'yan ha.

1342
01:26:35,815 --> 01:26:39,944
Magaling na writer. Sige na.
Magsabi ka ng inspiring para sa Nanay mo.

1343
01:26:40,028 --> 01:26:41,738
Come on. Sige na!

1344
01:26:42,405 --> 01:26:43,698
Ano ba?

1345
01:26:43,781 --> 01:26:45,283
Madali lang sa 'yo!

1346
01:26:48,536 --> 01:26:50,038
'Tang ina, ang aarte n'yo.

1347
01:26:50,538 --> 01:26:52,373
Ito na lang. Okay, ganito.

1348
01:26:53,541 --> 01:26:54,667
Jo, tandaan mo 'to.

1349
01:26:56,711 --> 01:27:01,466
Niyakap niya nang buo ang kanyang mundo
at nabuhay nang lubos.

1350
01:27:02,342 --> 01:27:04,802
Sa kasamaang-palad,
di mabuti ang buhay sa kanya.

1351
01:27:06,512 --> 01:27:09,182
At pinahirapan siya
ng masasakit na karanasan.

1352
01:27:10,350 --> 01:27:13,770
Pero kahit ganoon,
nanatili siyang mapagbigay

1353
01:27:14,854 --> 01:27:16,481
at hindi makasarili.

1354
01:27:17,899 --> 01:27:18,858
Gano'n.

1355
01:27:20,610 --> 01:27:23,571
Okay. Iba naman. Kunwari… Iba.

1356
01:27:23,655 --> 01:27:24,906
Take two.

1357
01:27:24,989 --> 01:27:29,160
Niyakap niya ang mundo nang buo.

1358
01:27:29,244 --> 01:27:32,080
Nabuhay nang walang takot.

1359
01:27:33,164 --> 01:27:37,252
Sa kasamaang-palad,
di mabuti ang buhay sa kanya.

1360
01:27:38,378 --> 01:27:40,964
At pinahirapan siya
ng masasakit na karanasan.

1361
01:27:42,006 --> 01:27:45,093
Pero kahit ganoon,
nanatili siyang mapagbigay

1362
01:27:46,052 --> 01:27:47,053
at hindi makasarili.

1363
01:27:48,179 --> 01:27:49,389
O di ba?

1364
01:27:49,472 --> 01:27:51,015
Paz. Aming Paz.

1365
01:27:52,892 --> 01:27:55,395
Ang aming maningning na bituin…
Ay, ang ganda no'n.

1366
01:27:55,895 --> 01:27:57,605
Ang aming maningning na bituin…

1367
01:27:58,564 --> 01:28:02,318
ay nasa piling na ng mga tala,
sa lugar kung saan siya nararapat.

1368
01:28:03,653 --> 01:28:05,571
Di lang siya magaling na artista,

1369
01:28:05,655 --> 01:28:08,616
mapagmahal din siyang ina.

1370
01:28:10,702 --> 01:28:14,038
Mabuting kapatid, tapat na kabiyak.

1371
01:28:15,206 --> 01:28:17,333
At higit sa lahat. Siya…

1372
01:28:19,585 --> 01:28:21,004
Jo, ano? Ano?

1373
01:28:21,087 --> 01:28:23,131
May gusto ka bang sabihin, Joanne?

1374
01:28:23,798 --> 01:28:24,924
Wala.

1375
01:28:25,008 --> 01:28:26,092
Sige.

1376
01:28:28,636 --> 01:28:30,179
Maria Paz delos Santos.

1377
01:28:33,182 --> 01:28:35,727
Isang napakabuting ina.

1378
01:28:43,568 --> 01:28:44,610
[pabulong] Bullshit.

1379
01:28:45,611 --> 01:28:46,738
May sinabi ka ba?

1380
01:28:48,906 --> 01:28:51,159
Kung may sasabihin ka,
sabihin mo na. Sige na.

1381
01:28:51,701 --> 01:28:52,744
Ano?

1382
01:28:52,827 --> 01:28:56,414
Sa'n ako huhugot? E hindi kita kilala.

1383
01:28:56,497 --> 01:28:57,957
Sinisisi mo 'ko?

1384
01:28:58,041 --> 01:28:59,167
Sino pa ba?

1385
01:29:00,084 --> 01:29:01,669
Ako pa ba ang may kasalanan?

1386
01:29:01,753 --> 01:29:04,047
Okay, before you say anything,
wala kang alam.

1387
01:29:04,547 --> 01:29:06,549
Wala kang naiintindihan.

1388
01:29:07,216 --> 01:29:09,427
Ipaintindi mo sa akin.

1389
01:29:10,053 --> 01:29:12,138
Hindi mo alam ang pinagdaanan ko.

1390
01:29:12,722 --> 01:29:13,973
Hindi madali.

1391
01:29:15,224 --> 01:29:18,728
Pagkatapos kitang ipanganak,
kailangan kong tumigil sa trabaho.

1392
01:29:18,811 --> 01:29:21,022
Kailangan kong pakasalan ang tatay mo.

1393
01:29:21,105 --> 01:29:23,608
Maging mabuting asawa at mabuting ina.

1394
01:29:24,776 --> 01:29:26,569
Kailangan kong alagaan ang Nono mo.

1395
01:29:28,029 --> 01:29:30,365
Kailangan kong isakripisyo ang career ko.

1396
01:29:30,448 --> 01:29:32,867
Wala namang may gustong kumuha
sa 'yo, di ba?

1397
01:29:33,368 --> 01:29:35,078
Bakit hindi mo tanggapin?

1398
01:29:35,161 --> 01:29:37,246
Pinoprotektahan kita, Joanne.

1399
01:29:37,330 --> 01:29:39,624
Pinoprotektahan kita.
Kung hindi ako umalis…

1400
01:29:40,750 --> 01:29:43,086
Nasaktan ko ang sarili ko,
nasaktan lang kita.

1401
01:29:43,169 --> 01:29:44,504
E gano'n pa rin naman.

1402
01:29:45,046 --> 01:29:46,756
Nasaktan mo pa rin ako.

1403
01:29:48,424 --> 01:29:52,386
Tapos ngayon, dahil wala ka ng pera,
dahil may sakit ka,

1404
01:29:52,470 --> 01:29:55,556
babalik ka dito nang walang kaabog-abog.

1405
01:29:56,182 --> 01:29:58,851
At gusto mo na itigil namin ang lahat.

1406
01:29:58,935 --> 01:30:01,062
Di ko hiniling na alagaan n'yo ako.

1407
01:30:03,439 --> 01:30:04,899
Hindi kailanman.

1408
01:30:06,651 --> 01:30:08,361
Bakit mo ko pinapunta dito?

1409
01:30:09,445 --> 01:30:12,865
Dahil gusto kong makita
kung ayos ka, bago ako mamatay.

1410
01:30:14,450 --> 01:30:17,578
Para? Pampalubag-loob.

1411
01:30:17,662 --> 01:30:21,165
Na okay ang buhay ng batang iniwan mo.

1412
01:30:23,209 --> 01:30:25,419
Aminin mo muna ang kasalanan mo.

1413
01:30:25,503 --> 01:30:28,256
Diyos ko. Joanne.

1414
01:30:30,049 --> 01:30:32,260
Bakit sobrang laki ng galit mo?

1415
01:30:32,343 --> 01:30:36,472
Oo. Oo, talaga. Sobra!

1416
01:30:38,224 --> 01:30:40,560
Sa haba ng panahon na iniwan mo 'ko…

1417
01:30:41,561 --> 01:30:45,064
nang walang paliwanag.

1418
01:30:47,441 --> 01:30:51,362
Iniwan mo 'ko no'ng bata ako.

1419
01:30:53,197 --> 01:30:55,324
Bakit, Ma? Bakit?

1420
01:30:55,950 --> 01:30:58,703
Sabihin mo sa 'kin anong kasalanan ko?

1421
01:30:58,786 --> 01:31:00,746
-Di ako—
-Ano'ng mali sa 'kin?

1422
01:31:00,830 --> 01:31:02,790
Hindi ako maayos!

1423
01:31:05,418 --> 01:31:07,170
[pabulong] Di maayos?

1424
01:31:10,173 --> 01:31:11,716
Okay.

1425
01:31:14,427 --> 01:31:17,180
Kaya ka nagpunta ng Amerika?

1426
01:31:18,222 --> 01:31:20,850
Nagbuhay dalaga ka do'n.

1427
01:31:20,933 --> 01:31:24,145
Humanap ka ng lalaki.
Nag-anak ka pa ng isa!

1428
01:31:24,812 --> 01:31:27,315
Wala kang karapatang husgahan ako.

1429
01:31:28,649 --> 01:31:32,028
Di mo alam ang pinagdaanan ko sa New York.

1430
01:31:33,821 --> 01:31:37,200
Tingin mo napakatalino mo?

1431
01:31:37,283 --> 01:31:39,410
Kailangan kong maging matalino!

1432
01:31:42,038 --> 01:31:45,625
Walang gumabay sa 'kin ng 27 years.

1433
01:31:46,834 --> 01:31:48,377
Ako lang.

1434
01:31:51,672 --> 01:31:54,175
Pero, may narating pa rin ako.

1435
01:31:56,344 --> 01:31:57,261
Look at you.

1436
01:32:00,014 --> 01:32:03,309
Look at you. Walang nangyari sa buhay mo.

1437
01:32:04,560 --> 01:32:07,063
Ako? Kahit wala ka…

1438
01:32:09,023 --> 01:32:10,524
naging okay ako.

1439
01:32:16,364 --> 01:32:17,823
E di, mabuti.

1440
01:32:19,909 --> 01:32:24,956
Masaya akong nakahanap ka
ng peace dahil sa therapy

1441
01:32:25,623 --> 01:32:30,878
sa… sa guwapong psychiatrist
na karelasyon mo.

1442
01:32:31,671 --> 01:32:33,089
Ang galing, ha.

1443
01:32:35,007 --> 01:32:36,425
Sino'ng makasarili ngayon?

1444
01:32:38,135 --> 01:32:42,431
Ipinagpapaliban ko ang mga pangarap ko
para makasama ka.

1445
01:32:42,515 --> 01:32:45,309
-Di ko 'yon hiningi!
-Kasi hindi ako kagaya mo.

1446
01:32:45,977 --> 01:32:51,232
Kasi hindi maaatim ng konsensiya ko
na pabayaan ka at iwan ka.

1447
01:32:51,315 --> 01:32:52,984
Ayun na nga, ha?

1448
01:32:54,527 --> 01:32:56,237
Lumabas din.

1449
01:32:58,614 --> 01:33:04,161
Ang rason kaya ka nandito
ay para sa sarili mo,

1450
01:33:04,954 --> 01:33:07,248
para gumaan ang pakiramdam mo.

1451
01:33:07,331 --> 01:33:13,838
O para ipakita sa lahat na mas angat ka
kaysa sa talunan mong nanay, ganoon ba?

1452
01:33:14,672 --> 01:33:16,590
'Yan naman ang drama mo, di ba?

1453
01:33:20,845 --> 01:33:22,930
Di ka nakakaangat.

1454
01:33:24,015 --> 01:33:28,269
Galing ka sa mahabang linya
ng mga narcissist at mayayabang na mga tao

1455
01:33:28,352 --> 01:33:33,566
na isinasantabi ang mahihirap na usapan,

1456
01:33:33,649 --> 01:33:37,862
nagpapanggap na maayos
ang lahat kahit hindi.

1457
01:33:39,905 --> 01:33:44,452
Tapos tatakas tayo. Dahil 'yon
ang ginagawa natin, pareho tayong dalawa.

1458
01:33:45,286 --> 01:33:47,246
-Bakit di ka na lang kasi…
-Ano?

1459
01:33:47,955 --> 01:33:49,749
Mag-sorry?

1460
01:33:50,958 --> 01:33:56,339
[kulog at malakas na hangin]

1461
01:34:11,896 --> 01:34:13,481
Mag-iingat ka palagi, ha?

1462
01:34:19,570 --> 01:34:21,906
-Jo, 'nak, telepono mo.
-'Nay.

1463
01:34:27,453 --> 01:34:29,372
Magpaalam ka sa nanay mo.

1464
01:34:45,805 --> 01:34:47,556
I love you.

1465
01:34:47,640 --> 01:34:49,600
-Ingat ka.
-I love you.

1466
01:35:00,027 --> 01:35:01,362
[busina ng mga sasakyan]

1467
01:35:28,973 --> 01:35:31,058
<i>-Oh, hi.</i>
-Hi, Ben.

1468
01:35:31,142 --> 01:35:33,602
<i>-Oh.</i>
-Sorry. Nagising ba kita?

1469
01:35:33,686 --> 01:35:35,354
<i>Hindi, ayos lang.</i>

1470
01:35:35,438 --> 01:35:38,023
Pinadala ko sa email
'yong final treatment.

1471
01:35:38,107 --> 01:35:41,277
<i>-Ay. Ayos. Magaling.</i>
-Gawin na natin 'to.

1472
01:35:43,028 --> 01:35:44,822
<i>Pero, parang di ka masaya.</i>

1473
01:35:44,905 --> 01:35:47,450
<i>-Ayos ka lang ba talaga?</i>
-Pagod lang ako.

1474
01:35:47,533 --> 01:35:49,243
<i>Okay, mabuti.</i>

1475
01:35:49,326 --> 01:35:52,830
<i>Kaya mo bang lumipad papunta dito</i>
<i>sa susunod na linggo, mga Martes?</i>

1476
01:35:53,330 --> 01:35:54,748
<i>Ano'ng tingin mo?</i>

1477
01:35:55,291 --> 01:35:57,668
-Martes.
<i>-Yeah, 'yon ay…</i>

1478
01:35:59,837 --> 01:36:01,547
Hello?

1479
01:36:22,193 --> 01:36:23,110
[kumakatok]

1480
01:36:29,533 --> 01:36:30,451
[malakas na pagkatok]

1481
01:36:30,534 --> 01:36:31,827
Sandali!

1482
01:36:35,539 --> 01:36:37,291
-Hi!
-Hey!

1483
01:36:37,958 --> 01:36:39,752
Nandito ka.

1484
01:36:39,835 --> 01:36:41,253
Una muna…

1485
01:36:44,298 --> 01:36:46,759
-Salamat.
-Oo naman.

1486
01:36:49,136 --> 01:36:53,182
Ay, ako lang. Sumakay ako ng bus.
Tinuruan ako ni Manang Des.

1487
01:36:53,265 --> 01:36:55,309
-Kita mo?
-Oh, okay.

1488
01:36:57,811 --> 01:36:59,063
Mauna na 'ko.

1489
01:36:59,146 --> 01:37:02,066
Uy! Matty, teka.

1490
01:37:02,149 --> 01:37:03,067
-Talaga?
-Oo.

1491
01:37:04,401 --> 01:37:06,403
Ihahatid na kita bukas sa sakayan.

1492
01:37:15,496 --> 01:37:17,331
So, umm…

1493
01:37:18,415 --> 01:37:20,626
Gutom ka ba? Kumain ka na?

1494
01:37:23,003 --> 01:37:26,382
May tira akong pasta at beer.

1495
01:37:26,465 --> 01:37:28,717
Oh, pabili ng beer?

1496
01:37:30,553 --> 01:37:33,222
-It's "pahingi."
-Whatever.

1497
01:37:42,815 --> 01:37:44,525
Aalis na ako sa susunod na linggo.

1498
01:37:46,652 --> 01:37:47,695
Agad-agad?

1499
01:37:48,404 --> 01:37:50,823
Paalis na dapat ako no'ng dumating kayo.

1500
01:37:53,867 --> 01:37:55,536
Excited ka ba?

1501
01:37:56,620 --> 01:37:57,746
Kinakabahan.

1502
01:37:58,664 --> 01:37:59,999
Kaya mo 'yan.

1503
01:38:00,791 --> 01:38:02,835
Anak ka ni Mama e.

1504
01:38:07,548 --> 01:38:09,091
Kumusta ang nanay mo?

1505
01:38:09,967 --> 01:38:11,844
Gano'n pa rin…

1506
01:38:12,553 --> 01:38:15,055
bitch pa rin.

1507
01:38:24,106 --> 01:38:25,816
Di mo siya nilayasan.

1508
01:38:25,899 --> 01:38:27,234
Si Mama?

1509
01:38:28,819 --> 01:38:30,154
Hindi.

1510
01:38:32,239 --> 01:38:35,409
Kahit na sinisigawan na niya ako…

1511
01:38:36,535 --> 01:38:38,454
ramdam ko pa ring mahal niya ako.

1512
01:38:40,998 --> 01:38:46,128
Gusto ko pag nanonood kami ng pelikula
at hihiga ako sa tabi niya.

1513
01:38:48,631 --> 01:38:51,759
At gusto ko rin
na lagi siyang amoy sigarilyo.

1514
01:38:53,177 --> 01:38:54,803
Medyo kakaiba.

1515
01:38:55,512 --> 01:38:59,475
Naglalakad kami tuwing Linggo sa New York.

1516
01:39:01,018 --> 01:39:05,939
At ikinukuwento niya ang Pilipinas,
kung gaano kaganda.

1517
01:39:06,565 --> 01:39:10,486
{\an8}At kinukuwento niya kung paanong nakikita
niya ang sarili niya sa 'yo.

1518
01:39:12,738 --> 01:39:15,199
{\an8}Tapos tatahimik lang siya
ng ilang sandali.

1519
01:39:17,368 --> 01:39:19,495
{\an8}At maglalakad lang kami nang maglalakad.

1520
01:39:20,579 --> 01:39:22,289
{\an8}At di siya magsasalita.

1521
01:39:24,124 --> 01:39:25,751
{\an8}At lagi kong iniisip kung bakit.

1522
01:39:27,294 --> 01:39:29,046
{\an8}Siguro iniisip ka niya.

1523
01:39:32,758 --> 01:39:34,343
Ang totoo, iniisip ka niya.

1524
01:39:44,186 --> 01:39:45,562
[busina ng bus]

1525
01:39:50,859 --> 01:39:53,028
Di mo na kailangang maghintay.
Di ako mawawala.

1526
01:39:53,112 --> 01:39:56,198
It's okay. Let me check
kung ito 'yong bus mo.

1527
01:39:56,281 --> 01:39:57,616
Sakay na!

1528
01:40:00,577 --> 01:40:02,705
-Manong, Lucena 'to?
-Yes po, ma'am.

1529
01:40:03,288 --> 01:40:05,040
Heto na.

1530
01:40:05,124 --> 01:40:06,333
Sige na.

1531
01:40:07,459 --> 01:40:11,296
Good luck sa New York.
At ikain mo ako ng pizza.

1532
01:40:12,005 --> 01:40:14,049
Okay, sige.

1533
01:40:21,014 --> 01:40:23,267
Di ka naligo! Kadiri!

1534
01:40:23,350 --> 01:40:25,602
Kailangan ko ng instructions para makauwi.

1535
01:40:25,686 --> 01:40:27,271
See you!

1536
01:40:28,522 --> 01:40:29,940
Ingat.

1537
01:40:57,217 --> 01:40:59,136
[dramatikong musika]

1538
01:41:21,867 --> 01:41:24,369
[pasigaw] Manong! Tigil!

1539
01:42:02,866 --> 01:42:04,785
[lumalakas na musika]

1540
01:43:49,473 --> 01:43:51,725
[tunog ng gitara]

1541
01:45:32,826 --> 01:45:35,746
Pa, obvious pa rin 'yong crack.

1542
01:45:37,581 --> 01:45:40,834
Okay lang 'yan.
Di naman kailangan perpekto lahat.

1543
01:45:51,470 --> 01:45:52,763
Anak.

1544
01:45:54,639 --> 01:45:59,728
Pagpasensiyahan mo na sana kung madalas
di ako nakakapag-open up sa 'yo.

1545
01:46:01,229 --> 01:46:05,358
Lumaki kasi ako sa isang pamilyang
hindi nag-uusap.

1546
01:46:06,568 --> 01:46:08,612
Bawal magsabi ng emosyon.

1547
01:46:11,156 --> 01:46:12,949
Pero sana kahit papa'no…

1548
01:46:14,659 --> 01:46:17,120
malaman mo 'yong lalim
ng pagmamahal ko sa 'yo.

1549
01:46:25,754 --> 01:46:27,714
Pa, may galos ka pala d'yan?

1550
01:46:28,757 --> 01:46:30,092
Ito?

1551
01:46:30,967 --> 01:46:33,178
Matagal na 'to. Bata pa 'ko.

1552
01:46:35,263 --> 01:46:36,890
Nakalimutan ko na nga.

1553
01:46:41,061 --> 01:46:43,230
May mga galos talaga na forever.

1554
01:46:52,072 --> 01:46:55,033
Matty, parini na!

1555
01:46:55,909 --> 01:46:57,744
Ready na si Mama n'yo.

1556
01:46:58,829 --> 01:47:00,705
-Umahon ka na d'yan.
-Coming!

1557
01:47:03,291 --> 01:47:05,210
Dito talaga nilagay?

1558
01:47:05,293 --> 01:47:07,212
'Yan ang pinili ng Mama n'yo.

1559
01:47:08,296 --> 01:47:10,757
-Okay.
-Masungit pa rin.

1560
01:47:11,967 --> 01:47:15,762
[Des] Pagdating dito sa may tubig,
sabay-sabay nating isasaboy si Paz.

1561
01:47:15,846 --> 01:47:19,891
At kailangan mga nakangiti tayo.
Ayaw ng Mama mo ng malungkot.

1562
01:47:27,357 --> 01:47:28,733
-[Rene] Ayan na.
-[Des] Ano?

1563
01:47:28,817 --> 01:47:31,278
Di ba natin kailangang magdasal?

1564
01:47:33,321 --> 01:47:37,659
Panginoon, salamat po sa ulan, sa hangin.

1565
01:47:38,285 --> 01:47:43,790
At kahit na sa mga bagyong dumadaan,
at sa katiyakan ng pagsikat ng araw.

1566
01:47:45,125 --> 01:47:46,334
Amen.

1567
01:47:46,835 --> 01:47:49,171
-Amen!
-Amen!

1568
01:47:49,254 --> 01:47:53,425
[Des] Isa, dalawa… Nakangiti. Tatlo!

1569
01:47:54,301 --> 01:47:57,512
[umuubo ang lahat]

1570
01:48:00,390 --> 01:48:02,058
Isa pa.

1571
01:48:02,642 --> 01:48:05,770
-Sabay-sabay.
-Isa, dalawa, tatlo!

1572
01:48:05,854 --> 01:48:07,606
[tawanan]

1573
01:48:10,275 --> 01:48:13,195
Tara, halika na!

1574
01:48:13,278 --> 01:48:14,446
[masayang naghihiyawan]

1575
01:48:30,587 --> 01:48:31,880
[Jo] Mama!

1576
01:48:37,928 --> 01:48:40,013
[tumutugtog ang "Leaves"]

